47554077-6db8-4265-b8b5-26a68a5d007c	3602be1f-edc3-472f-b87f-99701b86ae4d	WA-01-DC GROUP CHAT	WHATSAPP	{"DC orders",Catalyn,"Majid Al Jassas","Ahmed Al Samarai","~ Will Zhao","Linda Said","Adrian Koverok",SYSTEM}	/backlog-uploads/47554077-6db8-4265-b8b5-26a68a5d007c_1775389944672_47554077-6db8-4265-b8b5-26a68a5d007c_1775337994936__chat.txt	[13/11/2024, 12:16:37] DC orders: ‎Messages and calls are end-to-end encrypted. Only people in this chat can read, listen to, or share them.\r\n[13/11/2024, 12:16:37] Catalyn: ‎Catalyn created group “DC orders”\r\n[13/11/2024, 12:16:37] DC orders: ‎Catalyn added you\r\n[13/11/2024, 12:17:12] Catalyn: Hello both , please any orders use this group as its easier to track\r\n[13/11/2024, 12:17:23] Catalyn: thank you :)\r\n‎[13/11/2024, 12:17:39] Catalyn: ‎image omitted\r\n[13/11/2024, 12:17:52] Catalyn: OB115-MOD - 100 Amp Electricity Meter. MID Certified. RS485 Modbus. Includes Split Core CT with 2m Cable. \n https://amzn.eu/d/4hBo0MO\r\n[13/11/2024, 12:18:01] Catalyn: 6 of the above (completed)\r\n[13/11/2024, 12:18:09] Majid Al Jassas: Thanks Catalyn\r\n[13/11/2024, 12:20:22] Catalyn: can you get me hardwood / ironwood ?other wise I can get it from TP\r\n[13/11/2024, 12:22:32] Ahmed Al Samarai: mfaria@providencerow.org.uk\r\n[13/11/2024, 12:24:40] Majid Al Jassas: how many m??\r\n[13/11/2024, 12:25:27] Catalyn: just 3 lengths for now\r\n[13/11/2024, 12:25:32] Catalyn: 6x2\r\n[13/11/2024, 12:25:56] Catalyn: ideally 2.4m long\r\n[13/11/2024, 12:26:47] Majid Al Jassas: let me see what i can do\r\n[13/11/2024, 12:27:06] Catalyn: other wise for now any red hard wood ‎<This message was edited>\r\n[13/11/2024, 12:35:21] ~ Will Zhao: ‎Catalyn added ~ Will Zhao\r\n[13/11/2024, 13:00:48] Majid Al Jassas: @ Haji Ahmed Al Samarai, who am I sending invoices to?\r\n[13/11/2024, 13:04:42] Ahmed Al Samarai: @⁨Majid Al Jassas⁩ habibi. Please invoice Shuttleworth (UK) Ltd. Email myself, Catalin, Celine (celine@bedu.com) and Will (will@bedu.com)\r\n[13/11/2024, 13:11:24] Majid Al Jassas: Thank you boss!\r\n[13/11/2024, 13:50:07] Ahmed Al Samarai: @⁨~Will Zhao⁩ please talk to Celine later on in regards to fridges order.\r\n[13/11/2024, 18:01:34] Catalyn: @⁨Majid Al Jassas⁩ last message for today I promise 🙂\n\nThe above list when is it coming please ?\r\n[13/11/2024, 18:01:39] Catalyn: This one :)\r\n[13/11/2024, 18:21:57] Majid Al Jassas: Tomorrow\r\n[13/11/2024, 18:22:02] Majid Al Jassas: Both of them\r\n[14/11/2024, 09:29:17] ~ Will Zhao: morning, any update on the supply list?\r\n[14/11/2024, 09:48:01] Majid Al Jassas: Good Morning Will, deliveries will be on site today\r\n[14/11/2024, 09:50:17] ~ Will Zhao: would you mind sending the invoice to myself (will@bedu.com) celine (celine@bedu.com) and ahmed (ahmed@bed.com) please?\r\n[14/11/2024, 09:56:48] Majid Al Jassas: yes ofocourse\r\n[14/11/2024, 12:16:17] ~ Will Zhao: received, thanks!\r\n[14/11/2024, 12:31:40] Majid Al Jassas: no problem\r\n[14/11/2024, 12:52:48] Catalyn: Hello mate \nI hope you well \n\nWe will please need the following materials tomorrow no pressure \n\n1 pallet of 15mm soundblock plasterboard (siniat) taper edge \n10 length 3m long  of 72mm floor track \n10 length 3m long of 72mm ceiling track (deep) \n1box (1000pcs) 32mm drywall screws \n1box (1000pcs)50mm drywall screws \n1box of 50mm wood screws whatever quantity it’s fine \n5 rolls of 50mm isover insulation \n1box (100pcs)of nail anchors zinc \n5 duct tape any colour \n5bags of joint filler \n3bags easy filler \n3 rolls of screen tape \n1roll 120P sand paper (yellow) \n1roll 180P sand paper\n\nOverall all the dry lining materials siniat please ‎<This message was edited>\r\n[14/11/2024, 13:15:00] Majid Al Jassas: Does it have to be Sinniat\r\n[14/11/2024, 13:20:49] Catalyn: Selco sells sinniat\r\n[14/11/2024, 13:21:50] Ahmed Al Samarai: Makes\nThis one can be mixed and matched if you can get siniat quickly. Next order will have to be Siniat only.\r\n[14/11/2024, 13:24:05] Majid Al Jassas: @⁨Catalyn⁩ the delivery for electrics the first one is at the site\r\n[14/11/2024, 13:24:09] Majid Al Jassas: he’s calling you now\r\n[14/11/2024, 13:24:14] Majid Al Jassas: let me see how quick i can sort\r\n[14/11/2024, 13:24:27] Catalyn: Can I please add to the same order \n\n10pcs 4x2 at 3m long \n4 shattering plywood\r\n[14/11/2024, 13:25:18] Catalyn: Im with them\r\n[14/11/2024, 13:31:58] Majid Al Jassas: @⁨Catalyn⁩ can you give me more screws that you need for the job im getting them from a wholesaler and dont want to pay carriage on it\r\n[14/11/2024, 13:31:59] Majid Al Jassas: to save\r\n[14/11/2024, 14:23:34] Majid Al Jassas: What time are you guys on site until?\r\n[14/11/2024, 14:23:50] Catalyn: For  delivers?\r\n[14/11/2024, 14:23:53] Majid Al Jassas: yes\r\n[14/11/2024, 14:23:59] Majid Al Jassas: the breakers have just come into me\r\n[14/11/2024, 14:24:04] Majid Al Jassas: my dad will deliver them\r\n[14/11/2024, 14:24:11] Majid Al Jassas: he will need approximately an hour and 15 min\r\n[14/11/2024, 14:24:21] Catalyn: 24/7\r\n[14/11/2024, 14:24:31] Majid Al Jassas: amazing!\r\n[14/11/2024, 14:24:40] Catalyn: As long as it doesn’t need man power \nSmall items can oe collected but not heavy please\r\n[14/11/2024, 14:24:48] Majid Al Jassas: no worries\r\n[14/11/2024, 14:24:48] Catalyn: As we got a security guy 24/7\r\n[14/11/2024, 14:24:50] Majid Al Jassas: this is a small one\r\n[14/11/2024, 14:24:56] Catalyn: Other wise we are on site until around 6\r\n[14/11/2024, 14:40:57] Linda Said: ‎Catalyn added Linda Said\r\n[15/11/2024, 11:03:25] Catalyn: As per our telephone conversation please go ahead with the 40 numbers of 70mm studs at 3m long as it’s the longest they can supply \n\nThank you\r\n[15/11/2024, 11:04:03] Majid Al Jassas: no problem will get it there today but 25 pound delivery charge same day\r\n[15/11/2024, 11:04:15] Catalyn: Yes that’s fine\r\n[15/11/2024, 13:42:35] Majid Al Jassas: @⁨Catalyn⁩ just confirming did you recieve the pla