e=\\"color:rgb(34,34,34)\\"><span style=\\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\\"><i><span style=\\"color:rgb(191,144,0)\\"><b>w.</b></span></i><i>&nbsp;</i></span><a href=\\"https://www.regal-ltd.com/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" style=\\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\\"><i>https://www.regal-ltd.com/</i></a></div><div dir=\\"ltr\\" style=\\"color:rgb(34,34,34)\\"><span style=\\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\\"><font size=\\"2\\"><span style=\\"color:rgb(102,102,102)\\">Follow us on:</span><font face=\\"garamond, times new roman, serif\\">&nbsp;</font></font></span><font size=\\"4\\" face=\\"garamond, times new roman, serif\\"><span style=\\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\\"><font size=\\"2\\"><a href=\\"https://facebook.com/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" style=\\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\\"><span style=\\"color:rgb(11,83,148)\\">Facebook</span></a>&nbsp;<u><a href=\\"https://linkedin.com/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" style=\\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\\"><span style=\\"color:rgb(19,79,92)\\">LinkedIn</span></a></u>&nbsp;<u><a href=\\"https://twitter.com/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" style=\\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\\"><span style=\\"color:rgb(61,133,198)\\">Twitter</span></a></u>&nbsp;<u><a href=\\"https://www.instagram.com/regalconstructionservices/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" style=\\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\\"><span style=\\"color:rgb(153,0,0)\\">Instagram</span></a><br></u></font></span></font></div><div dir=\\"ltr\\" style=\\"color:rgb(34,34,34)\\"><font size=\\"4\\" face=\\"garamond, times new roman, serif\\"><span style=\\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\\"><font size=\\"2\\"><img src=\\"https://docs.google.com/uc?export=download&amp;id=1a8Y5M53u7BkyHzR8pXHgFPBPONt0APSa&amp;revid=0B2PNPWEax5mHbnVPK005VmVXQUZObGpOa0tvV0ZScEdnSGFjPQ\\" width=\\"200\\" height=\\"133\\"></font></span></font></div></div></div></div><br><br><div class=\\"gmail_quote gmail_quote_container\\"><div dir=\\"ltr\\" class=\\"gmail_attr\\">---------- Forwarded message ---------<br>From: <strong class=\\"gmail_sendername\\" dir=\\"auto\\">Adam Saleh</strong> <span dir=\\"auto\\">&lt;<a href=\\"mailto:qs@rcs-ltd.com\\">qs@rcs-ltd.com</a>&gt;</span><br>Date: Wed, Apr 15, 2026 at 5:27 PM<br>Subject: Request for Quotation / Sanitaryware and Tiling<br>To: &lt;<a href=\\"mailto:sales@cromwellplumbing.co.uk\\">sales@cromwellplumbing.co.uk</a>&gt;, &lt;<a href=\\"mailto:majid.aljassa@cromwellplumbing.co.uk\\">majid.aljassa@cromwellplumbing.co.uk</a>&gt;<br>Cc: Estimates Regal &lt;<a href=\\"mailto:estimates@rcs-ltd.com\\">estimates@rcs-ltd.com</a>&gt;, Anas Dore &lt;<a href=\\"mailto:anas@rcs-ltd.com\\">anas@rcs-ltd.com</a>&gt;, Wail Werfalli &lt;<a href=\\"mailto:wail@rcs-ltd.com\\">wail@rcs-ltd.com</a>&gt;<br></div><br><br><div dir=\\"ltr\\"><div>Salaams Majid,</div><div><br></div><div>I trust all is well.<br><br>On behalf of RCS, I am pleased to issue a Request for Quotation (RFQ) for the <u>supply only</u> of sanitaryware and tiling.</div><div><br></div><div>Please link to the Google Drive below.</div><div><a href=\\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1nWqvmwocFPeX4TrSw6BOppec54Mmyiya?usp=sharing\\" target=\\"_blank\\">https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1nWqvmwocFPeX4TrSw6BOppec54Mmyiya?usp=sharing</a></div><div><br></div><div>Within the tender pack please refer to the '<i>Bathroom</i>' folder for visuals, layouts and product selection.</div><div><br></div><div>Please submit your quote using the '<i>Sanitaryware Specification for 26 Park Hill</i>' Excel spreadsheet.</div><div><br></div><div>For the tiling specifications, please refer to&nbsp;tab '<i>6.TLNG</i>' in the '<i>Tender Bill of Quantities</i>' Excel spreadsheet, and submit a supply only quote.</div><div><br></div><div>As part of your quotation please kindly provide the following:</div><div>- Supply only price</div><div>- Payment terms, i.e. a deposit&nbsp;upfront to secure the order plus the remainder on delivery etc.</div><div>- Lead times for delivery to site (26 Park Hill, Ealing)</div><div>- Quotation expiry&nbsp;date (how long is the quote valid for?)</div><div>- Identify any risks that may impact cost, programme and quality (e.g. material availability, delivery delays)</div><div>- Identify and suggest any items missing from the sanitaryware specification / bathroom layout drawings (e.g. missing accessories, wastes, seals, fixing kits).</div><div>- Propose any value engineering solutions that may benefit all parties (e.g. alternative sanitaryware models, consolidation of product types, packaging reductions).</div><div><br></div><div>RFQ submission deadline: <b>30th April 2026</b></div><div><b><br></b></div><div>If you have any questions or comments, please let me know.</div><div><br></div><div>We look forward to receiving your quotation</div><div><br></div><div>Best regards</div><div><br></div><div><div dir=\\"ltr\\" class=\\"gmail_signature\\" data-smartmail=\\"gmail_signature\\"><div dir=\\"ltr\\"><div><font color=\\"#666666\\" face=\\"arial, sans-serif\\"><b>Adam Saleh <font size=\\"1\\">MRICS</font></b></font></div><div><font color=\\"#666666\\" face=\\"arial, sans-serif\\">Senior Quantity Surveyor</font></div><div><font color=\\"#666666\\" face=\\"arial, sans-serif\\">On behalf of</font></div><div style=\\"color:rgb(34,34,34)\\"><span style=\\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\\"><span style=\\"color:rgb(102,102,102)\\"><b>Regal Construction Services Ltd</b></span><br></span></div><div><span style=\\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\\"><span style=\\"color:rgb(127,96,0)\\"></span><i><span style=\\"color:rgb(191,144,0)\\"><b>e.</b></span><font color=\\"#222222\\">&nbsp;</font><u><font color=\\"#999999\\" style=\\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\\">qs</font></u></i><a href=\\"mailto:qs@rcs-ltd.com\\" target=\\"_blank\\" style=\\"font-style:italic\\"><font color=\\"#999999\\"><span style=\\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\\">@rcs-ltd.com</span><span style=\\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\\">&nbsp;</span></font></a><i style=\\"color:rgb(34,34,34)\\"><span style=\\"color:rgb(191,144,0)\\"></span>&nbsp;</i></span><i style=\\"color:rgb(34,34,34)\\"><span style=\\"color:rgb(191,144,0)\\"><b>t.</b></span>&nbsp;<span style=\\"color:rgb(102,102,102)\\">07969202674</span></i></div><div style=\\"color:rgb(34,34,34)\\"><span style=\\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\\"><i><span style=\\"color:rgb(191,144,0)\\"><b>w.</b></span></i><i>&nbsp;</i></span><a href=\\"https://www.regal-ltd.com/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" style=\\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\\"><i>https://www.regal-ltd.com/</i></a></div><div dir=\\"ltr\\" style=\\"color:rgb(34,34,34)\\"><span style=\\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\\"><font size=\\"2\\"><span style=\\"color:rgb(102,102,102)\\">Follow us on:</span><font face=\\"garamond, times new roman, serif\\">&nbsp;</font></font></span><font size=\\"4\\" face=\\"garamond, times new roman, serif\\"><span style=\\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\\"><font size=\\"2\\"><a href=\\"https://facebook.com/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" style=\\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\\"><span style=\\"color:rgb(11,83,148)\\">Facebook</span></a>&nbsp;<u><a href=\\"https://linkedin.com/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" style=\\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\\"><span style=\\"color:rgb(19,79,92)\\">LinkedIn</span></a></u>&nbsp;<u><a href=\\"https://twitter.com/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" style=\\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\\"><span style=\\"color:rgb(61,133,198)\\">Twitter</span></a></u>&nbsp;<u><a href=\\"https://www.instagram.com/regalconstructionservices/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" style=\\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\\"><span style=\\"color:rgb(153,0,0)\\">Instagram</span></a><br></u></font></span></font></div><div dir=\\"ltr\\" style=\\"color:rgb(34,34,34)\\"><font size=\\"4\\" face=\\"garamond, times new roman, serif\\"><span style=\\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\\"><font size=\\"2\\"><img src=\\"https://docs.google.com/uc?export=download&amp;id=1a8Y5M53u7BkyHzR8pXHgFPBPONt0APSa&amp;revid=0B2PNPWEax5mHbnVPK005VmVXQUZObGpOa0tvV0ZScEdnSGFjPQ\\" width=\\"200\\" height=\\"133\\"></font></span></font></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></body></html>", "cont