l is collected by the courier..</p></td></tr><tr></tr><tr><td style=\\"padding-bottom:20px; padding-left:20px; padding-right:20px\\"><p style=\\"text-align:left; color:#6F6F6F; font-family:Source Sans Pro Regular,Arial; font-size:16px\\"><span style=\\"text-decoration:underline\\"><a href=\\"https://mandrillapp.com/track/click/30007454/www.fedex.com?p=eyJzIjoiYUI4VVdiSi1fVEpYdG5YTnQxa0FqdGI1MGFnIiwidiI6MiwicCI6IntcInVcIjozMDAwNzQ1NCxcInZcIjoyLFwidXJsXCI6XCJodHRwczpcXFwvXFxcL3d3dy5mZWRleC5jb21cXFwvZmVkZXh0cmFja1xcXC8_dHJrbmJyPTg3MDY1NDc2Mjc3OFwiLFwiaWRcIjpcIjQ2YTY4ZTJkNDA0MjRiNDE5ZmI2NTdlMWY3ZmQwMzAzXCIsXCJ1cmxfaWRzXCI6W1wiNzU0MTEyNDMyZTE2MTA2ZGM3OWNhYzU2YzlhMWRkOTI2ODI4MDlhN1wiXSxcIm1zZ190c1wiOjE3NzYxODU3MDl9In0\\" style=\\"color:#59BB64\\">https://www.fedex.com/fedextrack/?trknbr=870654762778</a> </span>&nbsp; </p></td></tr><tr><td style=\\"padding-bottom:20px; padding-left:20px; padding-right:20px\\"><p style=\\"text-align:left; color:#6F6F6F; font-family:Source Sans Pro Regular,Arial; font-size:16px\\">Orders via FedEx normally arrive between 7am and 6pm on the next working day. You will normally receive a text message with a delivery slot once it has been assigned.</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\\"padding-bottom:20px; padding-left:20px; padding-right:20px\\"><p style=\\"text-align:left; color:#6F6F6F; font-family:Source Sans Pro Regular,Arial; font-size:16px\\">Your order will require a signature upon delivery and cannot be left in a safe location. If you are not home, FedEx may attempt to leave with a neighbour or will leave a contact card for you to rearrange delivery.</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\\"padding-bottom:20px; padding-left:20px; padding-right:20px\\"><p style=\\"text-align:left; color:#6F6F6F; font-family:Source Sans Pro Regular,Arial; font-size:16px\\"><b style=\\"color:#404040\\">Important information: </b>&nbsp; </p></td></tr><tr><td style=\\"padding-bottom:20px; padding-left:20px; padding-right:20px\\"><p style=\\"text-align:left; color:#6F6F6F; font-family:Source Sans Pro Regular,Arial; font-size:16px\\">In the rare and unfortunate event of your item(s) arriving damaged or missing, please notify our customer service department within 24 hours of delivery. The quickest way to get help for any issue is to start at our Help Centre. Our Customer Services team can be contacted by emailing <a href=\\"mailto:info@victorianplumbing.co.uk\\" style=\\"color:#59BB64\\">info@victorianplumbing.co.uk</a></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\\"padding-bottom:20px; padding-left:20px; padding-right:20px\\"><p style=\\"text-align:left; color:#6F6F6F; font-family:Source Sans Pro Regular,Arial; font-size:16px\\">We advise you not to book your installers or engage in any prep work until full receipt and inspection of your goods.</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\\"padding-bottom:20px; padding-left:20px; padding-right:20px\\"><p style=\\"text-align:left; color:#6F6F6F; font-family:Source Sans Pro Regular,Arial; font-size:16px\\">We update our product information and instructions regularly: for the latest product information and instructions please look up your product by using search bar <a href=\\"www.victorianplumbing.co.uk?utm_source=transactional&amp;utm_medium=Email&amp;utm_campaign=orderdispatch\\" style=\\"color:#59BB64\\">on our website.</a></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\\"padding-bottom:20px; padding-left:20px; padding-right:20px\\"><p style=\\"text-align:left; color:#6F6F6F; font-family:Source Sans Pro Regular,Arial; font-size:16px\\">Some local couriers may deliver between 6am and 9pm. If you live in a remote area, next working day may not be possible, so we recommend checking your tracking link for up to date information. Please note, any delays following dispatch are the responsibility of the courier.</p></td></tr><tr></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td height=\\"10\\" style=\\"padding:0; margin:0\\"></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\\"https://mandrillapp.com/track/click/30007454/www.victorianplumbing.co.uk?\\"><img width=\\"750\\" height=\\"180\\" src=\\"https://images.victorianplumbing.co.uk/images/Exclusive-Banner-Trade.png\\" alt=\\"trade-image\\"> </a></td></tr><tr><td height=\\"10\\" style=\\"padding:0; margin:0\\"></td></tr><tr><td><table cellspacing=\\"0\\" style=\\"padding:0; text-align:center; height:auto; border-radius:3px; background-color:#FFFFFF\\"><tbody><tr width=\\"100%\\"><td style=\\"padding-left:20px; padding-right:20px; padding-top:20px; padding-bottom:10px\\"><h1 style=\\"padding:0px; margin:0px; text-align:left; font-family:Filson Soft,Arial; font-size:22px; font-weight:600; color:#2c2c2f\\">Need Assistance? </h1></td></tr><tr width=\\"100%\\"><td style=\\"padding-left:20px; padding-right:20px; padding-top:10px; padding-bottom:10px\\"><h1 style=\\"padding:0px; margin:0px; text-align:left; font-family:Filson Soft,Arial; font-size:17px; font-weight:600; color:#2c2c2f\\">Tracking your order </h1><p style=\\"text-align:left; padding-top:10px; color:#6F6F6F; font-family:Source Sans Pro Regular,Arial; font-size:16px\\">The quickest way to track your order is using our <a href=\\"https://mandrillapp.com/track/click/30007454/www.victorianplumbing.co.uk?\\" style=\\"color:#59BB64\\">Track My Order</a> function on the Victorian Plumbing website. Input both your order number and email address in order to start tracking. We’ll email you throughout your order’s journey so you know when to expect it.&nbsp; </p></td></tr><tr width=\\"100%\\"><td style=\\"padding-left:20px; padding-right:20px; padding-top:10px; padding-bottom:10px\\"><h1 style=\\"padding:0px; margin:0px; text-align:left; font-family:Filson Soft,Arial; font-size:17px; font-weight:600; color:#2c2c2f\\">Returning items </h1><p style=\\"text-align:left; padding-top:10px; color:#6F6F6F; font-family:Source Sans Pro Regular,Arial; font-size:16px\\">If you would like to return an item from your order, it’s important that you follow the steps in our <a href=\\"https://mandrillapp.com/track/click/30007454/www.victorianplumbing.co.uk?p=eyJzIjoiWHIwQUl6c3V0UGFRN2hjY0lvNU9CT2l0VWJNIiwidiI6MiwicCI6IntcInVcIjozMDAwNzQ1NCxcInZcIjoyLFwidXJsXCI6XCJodHRwczpcXFwvXFxcL3d3dy52aWN0b3JpYW5wbHVtYmluZy5jby51a1xcXC9oZWxwLWFuZC1jdXN0b21lci1zZXJ2aWNlXFxcL3JldHVybi1wb2xpY3k_dXRtX3NvdXJjZT10cmFuc2FjdGlvbmFsJnV0bV9tZWRpdW09RW1haWwmdXRtX2NhbXBhaWduPW9yZGVyZGlzcGF0Y2hcIixcImlkXCI6XCI0NmE2OGUyZDQwNDI0YjQxOWZiNjU3ZTFmN2ZkMDMwM1wiLFwidXJsX2lkc1wiOltcIjBlZGI2YmZmYTZmYWVhODQwN2RlNDk1MThiNDNmZWE1ZTY2YzNmNzFcIl0sXCJtc2dfdHNcIjoxNzc2MTg1NzA5fSJ9\\" style=\\"color:#59BB64\\">Help Centre</a>. Items must be returned within 30 days, please ensure the item is not damaged or marked and within its original packaging. </p></td></tr><tr width=\\"100%\\"><td style=\\"padding-left:20px; padding-right:20px; padding-top:10px; padding-bottom:10px\\"><h1 style=\\"padding:0px; margin:0px; text-align:left; font-family:Filson Soft,Arial; font-size:17px; font-weight:600; color:#2c2c2f\\">I have a refund query </h1><p style=\\"text-align:left; padding-top:10px; color:#6F6F6F; font-family:Source Sans Pro Regular,Arial; font-size:16px\\">If you have returned an item to us, your refund can take up to 10 working days to be processed once received at our Returns Centre. If you are waiting on any type of refund, this may take up to 5 working days once processed. If you are still waiting, contact us via <a href=\\"https://mandrillapp.com/track/click/30007454/www.victorianplumbing.co.uk?\\" style=\\"color:#59BB64\\">our Refunds Section</a> in the Help Centre. </p></td></tr><tr width=\\"100%\\"><td style=\\"padding-left:20px; padding-right:20px; padding-top:10px; padding-bottom:20px\\"><h1 style=\\"padding:0px; margin:0px; text-align:left; font-family:Filson Soft,Arial; font-size:17px; font-weight:600; color:#2c2c2f\\">I have a damaged or faulty item </h1><p style=\\"text-align:left; padding-top:10px; color:#6F6F6F; font-family:Source Sans Pro Regular,Arial; font-size:16px\\">We’re sorry if you have received a damaged or faulty item. Please create a report in our <a href=\\"https://mandrillapp.com/track/click/30007454/www.victorianplumbing.co.uk?\\" style=\\"color:#59BB64\\">Help Centre</a> so we can resolve this as quickly as possible. Please do not fit or dispose of any damaged goods, as we will be unable to replace or refund damaged items which have been installed. </p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td height=\\"10\\" style=\\"padding:0; margin:0\\"></td></tr><tr><td><table cellspacing=\\"0\\" style=\\"padding:0; text-align:center; height:auto; border-radius:3px; background-color:#FFFFFF\\"><tbody><tr width=\\"100%\\"><td style=\\"text-align:center; padding-left:20px; padding-right:20px; padding-top:20px; padding-bottom:10px\\"><h1 style=\\"width:100%; padding:0px; margin:0px; text-align:center; font-family:Filson Soft,Arial; font-size:17px; font-weight:600; color:#2c2c2f\\">This Is A No Reply Email </h1></td></tr><tr width=\\"100%\\"><td style=\\"text-align:center; padding-left:20px; padding-right:20px; padding-top:10px; padding-bottom:20px\\"><p style=\\"text-align:center; color:#6F6F6F; font-family:Source Sans Pro Regular,Arial; font-size:16px\\">This update is sent from an address that cannot receive email. Replies to this email will not be seen by our team. The quickest way to get help is to report an issue via our <a href=\\"https://mandrillapp.com/track/click/30007454/www.victorianplumbing.co.uk?\\" style=\\"color:#59BB64\\">Help Centre</a>.&nbsp; </p></td></tr><tr width=\\"100%\\"><td class=\\"main-body\\"></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td height=\\"10\\" style=\\"padding:0; margin:0\\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\\"border-radius:3px; text-align:center; width:53%; max-width:600px; border:none; border-spacing:0; background-color:#ffffff\\"><table style=\\"text-align:center; width:100%\\"><tbody><tr width=\\"100%\\"><td style=\\"padding-left:20px; padding-right:20px; padding-top:20px; padding-bottom:10px\\"><h1 style=\\"width:100%; padding:0px; margin:0px; text-align:center; font-family:Filso