able law.<br><br>No Advice: Unless expressly stated otherwise and confirmed in a separate formal advice letter, nothing in this email constitutes legal, financial, tax or investment advice. No duty of care is assumed. You should seek appropriate professional advice before acting on any information contained herein.<br><br>Authorisation: No email instruction shall authorise expenditure or create contractual obligations unless confirmed by a duly executed purchase order or written contract signed by an authorised signatory of Criterion Capital Limited. </p></font></body></html>", "contentType": "html"}, "from": {"emailAddress": {"name": "Jas Kalsi", "address": "Jas.Kalsi@criterioncapital.co.uk"}}, "_folder": "INBOX", "subject": "FW: Criterion Hotel | PV Enabling Materials ", "@odata.etag": "W/\\"CQAAABYAAADjsLOgeeDySrc96zrOmMKkAAGH4qp1\\"", "bodyPreview": "Majid\\r\\n\\r\\nYour invoice 3897 should only have as per attached\\r\\n\\r\\nWho requested the other items, remove other items for now\\r\\n\\r\\nRegards\\r\\n\\r\\nJas Kalsi\\r\\n\\r\\nProcurement manager\\r\\n07540 719 864\\r\\n\\r\\nCriterion Capital\\r\\nC/O Zedwell Hotel, Great Windmill Street, London T", "ccRecipients": [], "toRecipients": [{"emailAddress": {"name": "Majid Al Jassas", "address": "majid.aljassas@cromwellplumbing.co.uk"}}], "conversationId": "AAQkAGUwNWEyYWNiLWJiZmMtNGVhYS1hNjI4LWMwNTcxN2U2NDhkNQAQACejTiNtYUkYm9HLGYPLcUI=", "hasAttachments": true, "receivedDateTime": "2026-04-15T09:01:25Z", "internetMessageId": "<AM9PR08MB7069DF5DCBD0F0C974ECC113D3222@AM9PR08MB7069.eurprd08.prod.outlook.com>"}	\N	2026-04-15 09:01:25	\N	ACTIONED	[ack-matcher] skipped NOISE: no supplier-doc signal	2026-04-16 09:14:14.22
