if\\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\\">Alternatively, you can pay us by Bank transfer (BACS) using the bank details provided in the proforma invoice.</span></p><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\\">To help us process your payment faster, please quote the proforma invoice#&nbsp;arTR2507pro as the payment reference.</span></p><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\\">&nbsp;</span></p><div><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span lang=\\"EN-IN\\" style=\\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\\">Kind regards,</span></p><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><b><span style=\\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\\">Solomon Anderson</span></b></p><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"\\"><a href=\\"mailto:finance@alannahrose.co.uk\\"><span lang=\\"EN-IN\\" style=\\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif; color:#7F7F7F; text-decoration:none\\">finance@alannahrose.co.uk</span></a></span><span lang=\\"EN-IN\\" style=\\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif; color:#7F7F7F\\"></span></p><table class=\\"MsoNormalTable\\" border=\\"0\\" cellspacing=\\"0\\" cellpadding=\\"0\\" style=\\"border-collapse:collapse\\"><tbody><tr><td width=\\"56\\" valign=\\"top\\" style=\\"width:42.15pt; padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt\\"><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\"><img border=\\"0\\" width=\\"41\\" height=\\"31\\" id=\\"_x0000_i1102\\" src=\\"cid:image002.png@01DCCC2F.BD5F9780\\" style=\\"width:.427in; height:.3229in\\"></span><span style=\\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\\"></span></p></td><td w