center; text-decoration:none; display:block; padding:10px 24px; border-radius:0px; -moz-border-radius:0px; -webkit-border-radius:0px; border:1px solid #B8FD00\\">Go To Yapily Console</a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr style=\\"\\"><td style=\\"color:#191919; font-family:'Helvetica',Arial,sans-serif; font-size:18px; line-height:125%; font-weight:400; text-align:left; margin-bottom:20px\\"><br><span style=\\"font-size:16px\\">If you are ready to speak with an open banking expert about your specific requirements, why not book a meeting with us now? <a href=\\"https://i.yapily.com/e/822123/-CT-APIConsoleDevRegistrations/37t1fq/2250463848/h/lAFgqYn9CcNGz3PxtBU5HgvWhJQH7CoPt4Kj16wGcv0\\">Get in touch with one of our experts today.</a></span></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style=\\"padding:40px 0 0\\"><table border=\\"0\\" cellpadding=\\"0\\" cellspacing=\\"0\\" role=\\"Presentation\\" width=\\"100%\\"><tbody></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr style=\\"\\"><td><table border=\\"0\\" cellpadding=\\"0\\" cellspacing=\\"0\\" role=\\"Presentation\\" width=\\"100%\\"><tbody><tr><td bgcolor=\\"#191919\\" style=\\"padding:72px 24px\\"><table border=\\"0\\" cellpadding=\\"0\\" cellspacing=\\"0\\" role=\\"Presentation\\" width=\\"100%\\"><tbody><tr style=\\"\\"><td style=\\"padding-bottom:24px\\"><a href=\\"https://i.yapily.com/e/822123/ce-newsletter-utm-medium-email/37t1ft/2250463848/h/lAFgqYn9CcNGz3PxtBU5HgvWhJQH7CoPt4Kj16wGcv0\\"><img alt=\\"\\" border=\\"0\\" height=\\"58\\" src=\\"https://i.yapily.com/l/822123/2022-10-11/27lmt8/822123/16654764585lAIfMf2/Yapily_Logo_White_RGB.png\\" width=\\"120\\" style=\\"width:120px; max-width:120px; height:58px; max-height:58px\\"> </a></td></tr><tr style=\\"\\"><td class=\\"mobile-px-0\\" style=\\"color:#ffffff; font-family:'Helvetica',Arial,sans-serif; font-size:18px; line-height:125%; font-weight:400; text-align:left; padding-right:168px; padding-bottom:10px\\">Build personalised financial experien