ite\\"><span style=\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\" style=\\"background:white\\"><span style=\\"font-size:7.5pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\\">The information transmitted including any attachments is intended only for the exclusive use of the person(s) or entity to which it is addressed and may contain confidential and privileged material that may be subject to legal privilege. Any perusal, review, retransmission, dissemination, distribution, reproduction or other use of, or taking of any action in reliance upon, this information by persons or entities other than the intended recipient without the sender's prior consent is unauthorised and strictly prohibited. If you have received this message in error, please notify the sender immediately and delete the message from your computer without making any copies. Any personal views and opinions expressed in this e-mail message are the sender's own and do not necessarily represent the views and opinions of the Company</span><span style=\\"font-size:7.5pt; color:black\\">.</span><span style=\\"font-size:7.5pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\\"></span></p><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\" style=\\"background:white\\"><span style=\\"font-size:7.5pt; color:black\\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><b><span style=\\"font-size:7.5pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; color:red\\">Crime and Fraud Alert:</span></b><b><span style=\\"font-size:7.5pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\\">&nbsp;</span></b><span style=\\"font-size:7.5pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\\">Please be aware that we do not send notification of changes to our bank details by email. Fraudsters have been impersonating individuals and organisations have been tricked into forwarding money to them. If you receive an email that appears to come from us providing different bank details to the ones we supplied to you or indicating a change in our bank details,&nbsp;<b>please contact Les Sykes on 07525 672382</b>. Do not reply to the email or act on any information contained in it. We cannot accept responsibility if you transfer money into an incorrect account.</span></p><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\">&nbsp;</p></div></body></html>", "contentType": "html"}, "from": {"emailAddress": {"name": "Catherine Halliday", "address": "catherine.halliday@ashworth.uk.com"}}, "_folder": "INBOX", "subject": "Cromwell Plumbing Limited 1500967", "@odata.etag": "W/\\"CQAAABYAAADjsLOgeeDySrc96zrOmMKkAAGEoDq6\\"", "bodyPreview": "Good afternoon,\\r\\n\\r\\nJanuary Account £2.113.66\\r\\n\\r\\nI have just left you a message, could you arrange payment for the January account and confirm when this will be received, please.\\r\\nOverdue account have been placed on stop.\\r\\n\\r\\nI look forward to hearing from ", "ccRecipients": [{"emailAddress": {"name": "Paul Brown", "address": "paul.brown@ashworth.uk.com"}}], "toRecipients": [{"emailAddress": {"name": "Majid Al Jassas", "address": "majid.aljassas@cromwellplumbing.co.uk"}}], "conversationId": "AAQkAGUwNWEyYWNiLWJiZmMtNGVhYS1hNjI4LWMwNTcxN2U2NDhkNQAQADvRTu55zUzaiYxxNAZKia8=", "hasAttachments": false, "receivedDateTime": "2026-04-09T12:58:53Z", "internetMessageId": "<AM6PR09MB33184891799D1636F6460CF0D0582@AM6PR09MB3318.eurprd09.prod.outlook.com>"}	\N	2026-04-09 12:58:53	\N	ACTIONED	[ack-matcher] skipped NOISE: no supplier-doc signal	2026-04-16 09:15:06.852
