os_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module\\" data-hs-cos-general-type=\\"widget\\" data-hs-cos-type=\\"module\\" style=\\"color:inherit; font-size:inherit; line-height:inherit\\"><div id=\\"hs_cos_wrapper_module_16806183461411_\\" class=\\"hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_rich_text\\" data-hs-cos-general-type=\\"widget\\" data-hs-cos-type=\\"rich_text\\" style=\\"color:inherit; font-size:inherit; line-height:inherit\\"><h2 style=\\"margin:0; color:#1f1f25; line-height:172%; font-size:15px\\">Hi Majid,</h2><p style=\\"line-height:175%\\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\\"line-height:175%\\">Thank you for reaching out to us through our contact us form. We appreciate you expressing your interest in working with TrueLayer but unfortunately we're not the right fit for your requirements at this time and are unable to support you.</p><p style=\\"line-height:175%\\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\\"line-height:175%\\">As a growing company, we are committed to delivering the highest level of service to all our clients. To do this effectively, we are currently focusing our resources and expertise on onboarding clients who align with our target growth areas. This allows us to dedicate the necessary attention and resources to each project, ensuring we consistently deliver our best for each client.&nbsp;</p><p style=\\"line-height:175%\\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\\"line-height:175%\\"><span style=\\"color:#000000\\">Whilst at this time we cannot work directly with you, we do have a partnership with Stripe, and if you are still interested in working with TrueLayer, we encourage you to connect with their team via <a href=\\"https://ct61l04.na1.hubspotlinks.com/Ctc/ZR+113/ct61l04/VWBnpV1jMwYnW5cpr4s4DygRtW178YCN5MTk0jN7bK2_s3m2nnW7Y8-PT6lZ3kDW5kGznt7j9-6jN8fcBy4Q3X5ZW6Tvk0m4PsSYmW2vTMCx8Drxd2W1MTx4G5_lWTzW23VK1n7jWlxJW1SHWKq2r1Yw0W8rX4nF2q0lY-W3l4v2N8ZTYCQW8mMq7y4R6S4RW6jq29v4S7Pn-W4DGRqD4CvppQW6nTdV01HmHkmW2BLRpZ8lZJdXW5hHhCV93VdmhW3dDMGn1J6QrQW5CnlgH12Msj_W7J3wZb4wH