:solid #E1E1E1 1.0pt; padding:3.0pt 0cm 0cm 0cm\\"><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"background:lime\\">Hi Theo, nice to meet you too!</span><span lang=\\"EN-US\\" style=\\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\\"></span></p></div></div><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\">&nbsp;</p><div><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"color:black\\">&nbsp;</span></p></div><div><ul type=\\"disc\\"><li class=\\"MsoNormal\\" style=\\"color:black\\">CDL to place order for 37 mirrors, in addition Illuminated Mirrors will supply 9 mirrors FOC.<span style=\\"color:windowtext\\"> <span style=\\"background:lime\\">Agreed, we await your nod and I will rasie pro forma with Majid</span></span></li></ul></div><div><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"color:black\\">&nbsp;</span></p></div><div><ul type=\\"disc\\"><li class=\\"MsoNormal\\" style=\\"color:black\\">&nbsp;When these 46 mirrors are supplied, 25 will replace broken, dirty or faulty mirrors in ZPAR Phase 1 (as detailed in the room by room survey, attached)<span style=\\"color:windowtext\\"> <span style=\\"background:lime\\">agreed</span></span></li></ul></div><div><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"color:black\\">&nbsp;</span></p></div><div><ul type=\\"disc\\"><li class=\\"MsoNormal\\" style=\\"color:black\\">21 will be allocated to ZPAR phase 2 as required by <a id=\\"OWAAM99090\\" href=\\"mailto:Alex.Mincu@criterioncapital.co.uk\\"><span style=\\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif; text-decoration:none\\">@Alex Mincu</span></a><span style=\\"color:windowtext; background:lime\\"> agreed</span></li></ul></div><div><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"color:black\\">&nbsp;</span></p></div><div><ul type=\\"disc\\"><li class=\\"MsoNormal\\" style=\\"color:black\\"><a id=\\"OWAAM219527\\" href=\\"mailto:Niall.OReilly@criterioncapital.co.uk\\"><span style=\\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif; text-decoration:none\\">@Niall O'Reilly</span></a>&nbsp;will oversee arrival of new mirrors&nbsp;and record their condition at that time.</li></ul></div><div><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\" style=\\"margin-left:36.0pt\\"><span style=\\"color:black\\">*Any breakages discovered to be reported within 24hrs of receiving the goods*</span> <span style=\\"background:lime\\">As the items are taken off the pallets photo’s of any I damage must be made whilst the item is on the pallet (film will be removed and damage photo’d</span>. <span style=\\"background:lime\\">Note we do not expect the driver to be waiting of course</span><span style=\\"color:black\\"></span></p></div><div><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\" style=\\"margin-left:36.0pt\\"><span style=\\"color:black\\">&nbsp;</span></p></div><div><ul type=\\"disc\\"><li class=\\"MsoNormal\\" style=\\"\\"><span style=\\"color:black\\">IM to supply additional wrapping and a handling protocol to be followed on site when unwrapping the mirrors upon receipt, also a packaging guide for the mirrors to be returned to IM</span><br><br><span style=\\"background:lime\\">Step 1: Pallet arrives. Take photo of complete pallet<br>Step 2: Create a safe space inside location to stack mirrors flat (no more than 3 on a pile) BUT you must use the white foam we have provided to put between each layer! (We will send a video of this before we ship showing what to do<br>Step 3: carefully cut out film on pallet to free up the mirrors then begin removing mirrors from pallet. Take off all the packing you see on the mirror (blue foam) and keep it. Check each mirror and if good begin to stack in location.<br>Step 4: After all mirrors off pallet begin to use all the blue foam and film to protect each mirror coming back to us. <br>Step 5: Add to pallet like we did then when all on fully wrap the entire pallet. I will send video showing all</span></li></ul><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\" style=\\"margin-left:36.0pt\\">&nbsp;</p></div><div><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"color:black\\">&nbsp;</span></p></div><div><ul type=\\"disc\\"><li class=\\"MsoNormal\\" style=\\"color:black\\"><a id=\\"OWAAM49929\\" href=\\"mailto:majid.aljassas@cromwellplumbing.co.uk\\"><span style=\\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif; text-decoration:none\\">@Majid Al Jassas</span></a>&nbsp;will organise return of the 15 mirrors with dirt ingress or faults to IM</li></ul></div><div><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"color:black\\">&nbsp;</span></p></div><div><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"color:black\\">See below for breakdown</span></p></div><div><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"color:black\\">&nbsp;</span></p></div><table class=\\"MsoNormalTable\\" border=\\"1\\" cellspacing=\\"0\\" cellpadding=\\"0\\" id=\\"table_0\\" style=\\"border-collapse:collapse; box-sizing:border-box; border-spacing:0px\\"><tbody><tr><td width=\\"519\\" valign=\\"top\\" style=\\"width:389.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; border-color:initial\\"><div><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\" style=\\"line-height:120%\\"><span style=\\"color:black\\">Mirrors broken during installation to be re-purchased by CDL</span></p></div></td><td width=\\"104\\" valign=\\"top\\" style=\\"width:77.9pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left:none; padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt\\"><div><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\" style=\\"line-height:120%\\"><span style=\\"color:black\\">10</span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td width=\\"519\\" valign=\\"top\\" style=\\"width:389.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt\\"><div><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\" style=\\"line-height:120%\\"><span style=\\"color:black\\">Mirrors with minor dust ingress to be returned to IM for cleaning (FOC)</span></p></div><div><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\" style=\\"line-height:120%\\"><span style=\\"color:black\\">These are to supplied as part of phase 2 order</span></p></div></td><td width=\\"104\\" valign=\\"top\\" style=\\"width:77.9pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm