ions through its internal and external networks in accordance with applicable law.</span></p><p class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"text-align:left; text-indent:0px; background-color:rgb(255,255,255); margin:0cm\\"><span style=\\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:8pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\\">No Advice: Unless expressly stated otherwise and confirmed in a separate formal advice letter, nothing in this email constitutes legal, financial, tax or investment advice. No duty of care is assumed. You should seek appropriate professional advice before acting on any information contained herein.</span></p><p class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"text-align:left; text-indent:0px; background-color:rgb(255,255,255); margin:0cm\\"><span style=\\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:8pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\\">Authorisation: No email instruction shall authorise expenditure or create contractual obligations unless confirmed by a duly executed purchase order or written contract signed by an authorised signatory of Criterion Capital Limited.</span></p><div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"text-align:left; text-indent:0px; background-color:white; margin:0cm; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:black\\"><br></div><div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\\"><br></div></div><hr style=\\"height:1px; padding:0; margin:20px 0 10px 0; color:#323231; background-color:#323231\\"><font face=\\"Tahoma, sans-serif\\" color=\\"#323231\\" size=\\"2pt\\"><p style=\\"font-weight:normal; padding:0pt; margin:0pt\\">Confidentiality Notice: This email is intended solely for the named recipient(s). It may contain privileged and confidential information.<br><br>If you are not the intended recipient, notify the sender immediately and destroy this email and all copies. You must not copy, distribute, or take action in reliance upon it. Unauthorised use or disclosure is strictly prohibited and may be unlawful. <br><br>Data Protection: Criterion Capital Limited processes personal data in accordance with the UK GDPR and Data Protection Act 2018. For information about how we handle personal data, please see our Privacy Policy at our website. <br><br>Viruses: Whilst reasonable efforts are made to safeguard emails, the company provides no warranties and accepts no liability for viruses, malware, or system incompatibility. Recipients should undertake their own virus checks.<br><br>Monitoring: Criterion Capital Limited reserves the right to monitor all email communications through its internal and external networks in accordance with applicable law.<br><br>No Advice: Unless expressly stated otherwise and confirmed in a separate formal advice letter, nothing in this email constitutes legal, financial, tax or investment advice. No duty of care is assumed. You should seek appropriate professional advice before acting on any information contained herein.<br><br>Authorisation: No email instruction shall authorise expenditure or create contractual obligations unless confirmed by a duly executed purchase order or written contract signed by an authorised signatory of Criterion Capital Limited. </p></font></body></html>", "contentType": "html"}, "from": {"emailAddress": {"name": "Accounts Payable Construction", "address": "accounts@criteriondevelopment.com"}}, "_folder": "INBOX", "subject": "Remit", "@odata.etag": "W/\\"CQAAABYAAADjsLOgeeDySrc96zrOmMKkAAGAbkyb\\"", "bodyPreview": "Hi Majid,\\r\\n\\r\\nPlease see remit\\r\\n\\r\\n Amount\\r\\n Creditor Names\\r\\nInvoice/PF\\r\\nInvoice Date\\r\\n £       1,782.00\\r\\nCromwell Plumbing Ltd\\r\\nINV-004562\\r\\n17/02/2026\\r\\n £       1,516.32\\r\\nCromwell Plumbing Ltd\\r\\nINV-004652\\r\\n17/02/2026\\r\\n £       1,754.50\\r\\nCromwell Plumbing L", "ccRecipients": [], "toRecipients": [{"emailAddress": {"name": "Majid Al Jassas", "address": "majid.aljassas@cromwellplumbing.co.uk"}}], "conversationId