xt\\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\\"MsoPlainText\\">It’s now overdue and the system would be putting it on hold <span class=\\"grame\\">shortly,</span> we’ll then need the payment to process any orders.</p><p class=\\"MsoPlainText\\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\\"MsoPlainText\\">If you have already made a payment recently (as in today), please disregard this email. Thank you for your prompt attention to this matter.</p><p class=\\"MsoPlainText\\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\\"MsoPlainText\\">I look forward to hearing from you.</p><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:11.0pt\\">&nbsp;</span></p><div><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\">Kind Regards<span style=\\"font-size:11.0pt\\"></span></p><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-family:Montserrat\\">Cess Castillo</span></p><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><b><span style=\\"font-family:Montserrat\\">Accountant</span></b></p><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:Montserrat\\">T: 01494 341 523</span></p><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:Montserrat\\">E: <a href=\\"mailto:Cess@yesltd.org\\">Cess@yesltd.org</a><span style=\\"color:black\\"></span></span></p><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:5.0pt\\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><img border=\\"0\\" width=\\"117\\" height=\\"117\\" id=\\"Picture_x0020_1\\" src=\\"cid:image001.png@01DCC80F.BB577D50\\" style=\\"width:1.2166in; height:1.2166in\\"><span style=\\"font-size:11.0pt\\"></span></p><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:5.0pt\\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:8.0pt; font-family:&quot;Montserrat Light&quot;\\">Young’s Extract Limited Company Number: 03326406</span></p><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:8.0pt; font-family:&quot;Montserrat Light&quot;\\">Phoenix Park, Unit 4 Apsley Way, London NW2 7LN</span><img border=\\"0\\" width=\\"350\\" height=\\"45\\" id=\\"Picture_x0020_3\\" src=\\"cid:image002.