r-td\\" valign=\\"top\\" style=\\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:15px; color:#000000; word-break:break-word\\"><div id=\\"hs_cos_wrapper_main\\" class=\\"hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_email_flex_area\\" data-hs-cos-general-type=\\"widget\\" data-hs-cos-type=\\"email_flex_area\\" style=\\"color:inherit; font-size:inherit; line-height:inherit\\"><div id=\\"builtin_section-0\\" class=\\"hse-section hse-section-full-width\\" bgcolor=\\"#ffffff\\" style=\\"padding-left:10px; padding-right:10px; padding:0; background-color:#ffffff\\"><div class=\\"hse-column-container\\" style=\\"min-width:280px; max-width:100%; margin:0\\"><div id=\\"builtin_column_0-0\\" class=\\"hse-column\\"><table role=\\"presentation\\" cellpadding=\\"0\\" cellspacing=\\"0\\" width=\\"100%\\" class=\\"\\" style=\\"\\"><tbody><tr><td class=\\"hs_padded\\" style=\\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:15px; color:#000000; word-break:break-word; padding:0px 20px 0px 0px\\"><div id=\\"hs_cos_wrapper_module_16857076122661\\" class=\\"hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module\\" data-hs-cos-general-type=\\"widget\\" data-hs-cos-type=\\"module\\" style=\\"color:inherit; font-size:inherit; line-height:inherit\\"><div id=\\"hs_cos_wrapper_module_16857076122661_\\" class=\\"hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_rich_text\\" data-hs-cos-general-type=\\"widget\\" data-hs-cos-type=\\"rich_text\\" style=\\"color:inherit; font-size:inherit; line-height:inherit\\"><p align=\\"left\\" style=\\"font-family:calibri; font-size:15px; line-height:100%; text-align:left\\"><span style=\\"font-family:calibri\\">Dear Majid,</span></p><div style=\\"line-height:150%\\"><div style=\\"line-height:100%\\"><div data-olk-copy-source=\\"MessageBody\\" style=\\"line-height:175%\\"><div style=\\"line-height:100%\\"><div data-olk-copy-source=\\"MessageBody\\" style=\\"line-height:175%\\"><div data-olk-copy-source=\\"MessageBody\\" style=\\"line-height:175%\\"><div data-olk-copy-source=\\"MessageBody\\" style=\\"line-height:175%\\"><div data-olk-copy-source=\\"MessageBody\\" style=\\"line-height:100%\\"><div style=\\"line-height:115%\\"><div style=\\"line-height:175%\\"><div style=\\"line-height:115%\\"><div style=\\"line-height:125%\\"><div style=\\"line-height:115%\\"><div style=\\"line-height:100%\\"><span style=\\"font-family:calibri\\">&nbsp;</span></div><div style=\\"line-height:175%\\"><div data-olk-copy-source=\\"MessageBody\\" style=\\"line-height:125%\\"><span style=\\"font-family:calibri\\">Inviting Cromwell Plumbing to schedule a quick Teams call to discuss how Europe has always been Morocco's dominant supply market. Spain is Morocco's largest trading partner. France has 800+ active commercial entities in the country. German engineering is specified across its luxury hotels. Italian design sets the benchmark in five-star interiors. That dominance was built on proximity, quality, and decades of established trade. What is changing is the scale of demand - and the speed with which non-European suppliers are moving to capture it. Morocco is now executing the largest hotel development cycle in its history. </span></div><div data-olk-copy-source=\\"MessageBody\\" style=\\"line-height:125%\\">&nbsp;</div><div data-olk-copy-source=\\"MessageBody\\" style=\\"line-height:125%\\"><span style=\\"font-family:calibri\\">150,000+ new rooms. A $3B+ procurement mandate through 2030. And global manufacturers are entering this market aggressively, with competitive pricing and improving quality. European brands are actively positioned inside Morocco's procurement cycle.</span></div><div data-olk-copy-source=\\"MessageBody\\" style=\\"line-height:125%\\">&nbsp;</div><div data-olk-copy-source=\\"MessageBody\\" style=\\"line-height:125%\\"><span style=\\"font-family:calibri\\">&nbsp;</span></div></div></div></div></div></div><ul style=\\"line-height:115%\\"></ul></div><ul style=\\"line-height:175%\\"></ul></div></div></div></div>