data-hs-cos-general-type=\\"widget\\" data-hs-cos-type=\\"rich_text\\" style=\\"color:inherit; font-size:inherit; line-height:inherit\\"><div style=\\"line-height:150%\\"><div style=\\"line-height:100%\\"><div data-olk-copy-source=\\"MessageBody\\" style=\\"line-height:175%\\"><div style=\\"line-height:100%\\"><div data-olk-copy-source=\\"MessageBody\\" style=\\"line-height:175%\\"><div data-olk-copy-source=\\"MessageBody\\" style=\\"line-height:175%\\"><div data-olk-copy-source=\\"MessageBody\\" style=\\"line-height:175%\\"><div data-olk-copy-source=\\"MessageBody\\" style=\\"line-height:100%\\"><div style=\\"line-height:115%\\"><div style=\\"line-height:175%\\"><div style=\\"line-height:115%\\"><div style=\\"line-height:125%\\"><div style=\\"line-height:115%\\"><div data-olk-copy-source=\\"MessageBody\\" style=\\"line-height:175%\\"><div data-olk-copy-source=\\"MessageBody\\" style=\\"line-height:125%; font-size:15px\\"><div style=\\"line-height:100%\\"><p align=\\"justify\\" style=\\"text-align:justify; margin-top:7pt; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:7pt; padding-left:0cm; line-height:115%\\"><span style=\\"font-family:calibri\\">The FIFA World Cup 2030 deadline is not 2030. The hotels opening for the World Cup are being specified and procured right now. Developers are meeting with procurement teams. Interior designers are finalising material selections. FF&amp;E decisions for projects opening in 2026 and 2027 are being confirmed in the current quarter. European brands that are visible and commercially active in front of these buyers will win specification. Those that are not present will find their categories filled by alternatives - and re-entering a supply chain after specification is locked is significantly harder than being inside it from the start.</span></p></div><div style=\\"line-height:115%\\"><span style=\\"font-family:calibri\\">&nbsp;</span></div><div style=\\"line-height:115%\\"><span style=\\"font-family:calibri\\"><strong>The 6th Hospitality Innovation Summit – Morocco, 10-11 June 2026, <span style=\\"font-weight:bold\\">Four Seasons Hotel Rabat at Kasr Al Bahr </span>connects solution providers with 200+ developers, hotel operators, architects and procurement heads from Morocco's active hotel pipeline through pre-scheduled, face-to-face meetings.</strong>&nbsp;</span></div><div style=\\"line-height:115%\\"><span style=\\"font-family:calibri\\">&nbsp;</span></div><div style=\\"line-height:115%\\"><span style=\\"font-family:calibri\\">Ready for a quick 20 minutes Teams call this week?&nbsp;</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><ul style=\\"line-height:115%\\"></ul></div><ul style=\\"line-height:175%\\"></ul></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table><div id=\\"hs_cos_wrapper_module_17748514386601\\" class=\\"hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module\\" data-hs-cos-general-type=\\"widget\\" data-hs-cos-type=\\"module\\" style=\\"color:inherit; font-size:inherit; line-height:inherit\\"><div id=\\"hs_cos_wrapper_module_17748514386601_\\" class=\\"hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_rich_text\\" data-hs-cos-general-type=\\"widget\\" data-hs-cos-type=\\"rich_text\\" style=\\"color:inherit; font-size:inherit; line-height:inherit\\"><div style=\\"line-height:150%\\"><div style=\\"line-height:100%\\"><div data-olk-copy-source=\\"MessageBody\\" style=\\"line-height:175%\\"><div style=\\"line-height:100%\\"><div data-olk-copy-source=\\"MessageBody\\" style=\\"line-height:175%\\"><div data-olk-copy-source=\\"MessageBody\\" style=\\"line-height:175%\\"><div data-olk-copy-source=\\"MessageBody\\" style=\\"line-height:175%\\"><div data-olk-copy-source=\\"MessageBody\\" style=\\"line-height:100%\\"><div style=\\"line-height:175%\\"><div style=\\"line-height:115%\\"><div style=\\"line-height:175%\\"><div style=\\"line-height:115%\\"><div style=\\"line-height:115%\\"><div data-olk-copy-source=\\"MessageBody\\" style=\\"line-height