r\\n\\ttext-decoration:underline}\\r\\np.x_msonormal0, li.x_msonormal0, div.x_msonormal0\\r\\n\\t{margin-right:0cm;\\r\\n\\tmargin-left:0cm;\\r\\n\\tfont-size:12.0pt;\\r\\n\\tfont-family:\\"Aptos\\",sans-serif}\\r\\np.x_xmsonormal, li.x_xmsonormal, div.x_xmsonormal\\r\\n\\t{margin:0cm;\\r\\n\\tfont-size:12.0pt;\\r\\n\\tfont-family:\\"Aptos\\",sans-serif}\\r\\np.x_xelementtoproof, li.x_xelementtoproof, div.x_xelementtoproof\\r\\n\\t{margin:0cm;\\r\\n\\tfont-size:12.0pt;\\r\\n\\tfont-family:\\"Aptos\\",sans-serif}\\r\\np.x_xxmsonormal, li.x_xxmsonormal, div.x_xxmsonormal\\r\\n\\t{margin:0cm;\\r\\n\\tfont-size:12.0pt;\\r\\n\\tfont-family:\\"Aptos\\",sans-serif}\\r\\np.x_xxmsolistparagraph, li.x_xxmsolistparagraph, div.x_xxmsolistparagraph\\r\\n\\t{margin-right:0cm;\\r\\n\\tmargin-left:0cm;\\r\\n\\tfont-size:12.0pt;\\r\\n\\tfont-family:\\"Aptos\\",sans-serif}\\r\\nspan.x_EmailStyle22\\r\\n\\t{font-family:\\"Aptos\\",sans-serif;\\r\\n\\tcolor:windowtext}\\r\\nspan.x_EmailStyle23\\r\\n\\t{font-family:\\"Aptos\\",sans-serif;\\r\\n\\tcolor:windowtext}\\r\\nspan.x_EmailStyle24\\r\\n\\t{font-family:\\"Aptos\\",sans-serif;\\r\\n\\tcolor:windowtext}\\r\\nspan.x_EmailStyle25\\r\\n\\t{font-family:\\"Aptos\\",sans-serif;\\r\\n\\tcolor:windowtext}\\r\\nspan.x_EmailStyle26\\r\\n\\t{font-family:\\"Aptos\\",sans-serif;\\r\\n\\tcolor:windowtext}\\r\\nspan.x_EmailStyle30\\r\\n\\t{font-family:\\"Aptos\\",sans-serif;\\r\\n\\tcolor:windowtext}\\r\\n.x_MsoChpDefault\\r\\n\\t{font-size:10.0pt}\\r\\n@page WordSection1\\r\\n\\t{margin:72.0pt 72.0pt 72.0pt 72.0pt}\\r\\n-->\\r\\n</style><div lang=\\"EN-GB\\" style=\\"word-wrap:break-word\\"><p><span style=\\"color:#750b0b\\">[CAUTION: THIS IS AN EXTERNAL EMAIL. PLEASE DOUBLE CHECK THE EMAIL ADDRESS. Do not click links or attachments that are unexpected or from unknown senders.]</span>&nbsp;</p><div><div class=\\"x_WordSection1\\"><p class=\\"x_MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:11.0pt\\">Hi Harry, </span></p><p class=\\"x_MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:11.0pt\\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\\"x_MsoNormal\\">I have attached a drawing of our standard showerlay. Its for 800mm x 800mm but generally the only difference with the larger trays is the size and drain length. Generally the rule is that the drain length is 300mm less than the side of the showerlay on which it lies. So a 1200mm showerlay width with a 900mm drain, that's 150mm each side of the drain to the edge (D1) and 150mm from the edge of the showerlay to the side of the drain (C1).&nbsp;</p><p class=\\"x_MsoNormal\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p class=\\"x_MsoNormal\\">With a 20mm thick showerlay, the linear drain body will pertrude from the underside of the showerlay. This would need some thought on a wooden floor but not on a screeded concrete floor&nbsp;</p><p class=\\"x_MsoNormal\\">With 30mm and 40mm the linear drain body is more or less level with the underside&nbsp; of the showerlay.&nbsp;</p><p class=\\"x_MsoNormal\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p class=\\"x_MsoNormal\\">All are produced from XPS foam covered both sides in a cementous coating and reinforced net. The drain is factory built into the foam and is waterproofed into place.&nbsp;</p><p class=\\"x_MsoNormal\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p class=\\"x_MsoNormal\\">All showerlays have slopes from each corner to the corner of the linear drain.&nbsp;</p><p class=\\"x_MsoNormal\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p class=\\"x_MsoNormal\\">As with all cement coated showerlays, they must be waterproofed before tiling.&nbsp;</p><p class=\\"x_MsoNormal\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p class=\\"x_MsoNormal\\">I hope this helps.&nbsp;</p><p class=\\"x_MsoNormal\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p class=\\"x_MsoNormal\\">Thanks.&nbsp;</p><p class=\\"x_MsoNormal\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p class=\\"x_MsoNormal\\">John.&nbsp;</p><p class=\\"x_MsoNormal\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p class=\\"x_MsoNormal\\" style=\\"\\"><img width=\\"850\\" height=\\"828\\" id=\\"x__x0000_i1062\\" data-outlook-trace=\\"F:1|T:1\\" src=\\"cid:image001.png@01DCC20D.98D74380\\" style=\\"width:8.8541in; height:8.625in\\"></p><p class=\\"x_MsoNormal\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p class=\\"x_MsoNormal\\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\\"x_MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:11.0pt\\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\\"x_MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:11.0pt\\">&nbsp;</span></p><div><div><p class=\\"x_MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:11.0pt; color:black\\">Kind regards,</span><span style=\\"color:black\\"></span></p><p class=\\"x_MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:11.0pt; color:black\\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\\"x_MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:11.0pt; color:black\\">Majid Al Jassas</span></p><p class=\\"x_MsoNormal\\"><b><span style=\\"font-size:11.0pt; color:black\\">Managing Director | Cromwell Plumbing Ltd</span></b></p><p class=\\"x_MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:11.0pt; color:black\\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\\"x_MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:11.0pt; color:black\\">E:&nbsp;<a href=\\"mailto:majid.aljassas@cromwellplumbing.co.uk\\" title=\\"mailto:majid.aljassas@cromwellplumbing.co.uk\\"><span style=\\"color:#467886\\">majid.aljassas@cromwellplumbing.co.uk</span></a></span></p><p class=\\"x_MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:11.0pt; color:black\\">T: +44 203 621 0938</span></p><p class=\\"x_MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:11.0pt; color:black\\">M: +44 777 609 9987</span></p><p class=\\"x_MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:11.0pt; color:black\\">W:&nbsp;<a href=\\"http://www.cromwellplumbing.co.uk/\\" originalsrc=\\"http://www.cromwellplumbing.co.uk/\\" title=\\"http://www.cromwellplumbing.co.uk/\\"><span style=\\"color:#467886\\">www.cromwellplumbing.co.uk</span></a></span></p><p class=\\"x_MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:11.0pt; color:black\\">A: Ground Floor 423 Harrow Road London W10 4RE</span></p><p class=\\"x_MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:11.0pt; color:black\\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\\"x_MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:11.0pt; color:black\\">This email and any files transmitted with it are confide