ledgement.&nbsp; May I ask you to check the details carefully and contact us should you identify any discrepancies?</span></p><p class=\\"MsoPlainText\\"><span style=\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\\"MsoPlainText\\"><span style=\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\">All fittings are in stock and will be prepared for dispatch today.</span></p><p class=\\"MsoPlainText\\"><span style=\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\\"MsoPlainText\\"><span style=\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\">Kind Regards – Alison </span></p><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\\">&nbsp;</span></p><br><span style=\\"font-size:9pt; font-family:Arial; color:#000000; font-style:normal\\"><span style=\\"text-transform:uppercase\\">Alison Marshall</span><br>Customer Service Administrator <br><br><table><colgroup><col width=\\"5\\"><col width=\\"200\\"></colgroup><tbody><tr><td><span style=\\"font-size:9pt; font-family:Arial; color:#000000; font-style:normal\\">D:</span></td><td><span style=\\"font-size:9pt; font-family:Arial; color:#000000; font-style:normal\\">+44 (0) 1279 216 128</span></td></tr><tr><td><span style=\\"font-size:9pt; font-family:Arial; color:#000000; font-style:normal\\">T:</span></td><td><span style=\\"font-size:9pt; font-family:Arial; color:#000000; font-style:normal\\">+44 (0)1279 427 001</span></td></tr><tr><td><span style=\\"font-size:9pt; font-family:Arial; color:#000000; font-style:normal\\">W:</span></td><td><span style=\\"font-size:9pt; font-family:Arial; color:#000000; font-style:normal\\"><a href=\\"http://www.astrolighting.com\\" target=\\"_blank\\" style=\\"text-decoration:none\\"><font color=\\"#000000\\">www.astrolighting.com</font></a></span></td></tr></tbody></table><br><table border=\\"0\\" cellspacing=\\"0\\" cellpaddin