bc55b25d-1261-47d0-9ebc-717bfc5f6c4a	3d778a42-8957-4fcc-909e-b22d7d8fde64	<DBBPR08MB107469C3E2072326BD20FC40EDB202@DBBPR08MB10746.eurprd08.prod.outlook.com>	EMAIL	APPROVAL	{"id": "AAMkAGUwNWEyYWNiLWJiZmMtNGVhYS1hNjI4LWMwNTcxN2U2NDhkNQBGAAAAAACnmkWfBcR7QJIFP_7xkQVRBwDjsLOgeeDySrc96zrOmMKkAAAAAAEMAADjsLOgeeDySrc96zrOmMKkAAGKnX5fAAA=", "body": {"content": "<html><head>\\r\\n<meta http-equiv=\\"Content-Type\\" content=\\"text/html; charset=utf-8\\"><style type=\\"text/css\\" style=\\"display:none\\">\\r\\n<!--\\r\\np\\r\\n\\t{margin-top:0;\\r\\n\\tmargin-bottom:0}\\r\\n-->\\r\\n</style></head><body dir=\\"ltr\\"><div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\\">What about the rendering material?</div><div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\\">Can we get that to site today?</div><div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\\">What is the order quantity?</div><div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\\"><br></div><div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\\"><a href=\\"mailto:bes@acltd.co.uk\\" id=\\"OWAAM380807\\" class=\\"tWKOu mention ms-bgc-nlr ms-fcl-b\\">@Bes Lika</a>&nbsp;<a href=\\"mailto:majid.aljassas@cromwellplumbing.co.uk\\" id=\\"OWAAM251820\\" class=\\"tWKOu mention ms-bgc-nlr ms-fcl-b\\">@Majid Al Jassas</a>&nbsp;<a href=\\"mailto:Ovie.Okorafor@criterioncapital.co.uk\\" id=\\"OWAAM730070\\" class=\\"tWKOu mention ms-bgc-nlr ms-fcl-b\\">@Ovie Okorafor</a>&nbsp;<a href=\\"mailto:musa@safe-dem.com\\" id=\\"OWAAM508254\\" class=\\"tWKOu mention ms-bgc-nlr ms-fcl-b\\">@Musa Khan</a>&nbsp;copied in.&nbsp;</div><div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\\"><br></div><div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\\">Agreed on the colour, can't we change the spec slightly <a id=\\"OWAAM30802\\" class=\\"tWKOu mention ms-bgc-nlr ms-fcl-b\\" href=\\"mailto:Tim.Bystedt@criterioncapital.co.uk\\">@Tim Bystedt</a>&nbsp;to open up to more suppliers? Othewise good to place with this guy for Monday delivery Alex</div><div id=\\"appendonsend\\"></div><hr tabindex=\\"-1\\" style=\\"display:inline-block; width:98%\\"><div id=\\"divRplyFwdMsg\\" dir=\\"ltr\\"><font face=\\"Calibri, sans-serif\\" color=\\"#000000\\" style=\\"font-size:11pt\\"><b>From:</b> Alex Jones &lt;Alex.Jones@criterioncapital.co.uk&gt;<br><b>Sent:</b> 17 April 2026 12:13<br><b>To:</b> Omar Orders &lt;Omar.Orders@criterioncapital.co.uk&gt;<br><b>Cc:</b> Harry Johns &lt;Harry.Johns@criterioncapital.co.uk&gt;; Jas Kalsi &lt;Jas.Kalsi@criterioncapital.co.uk&gt;<br><b>Subject:</b> Window Rendering | 7 Leicester Place </font><div>&nbsp;</div></div><style>\\r\\n<!--\\r\\n@font-face\\r\\n\\t{font-family:\\"Cambria Math\\"}\\r\\n@font-face\\r\\n\\t{font-family:Aptos}\\r\\np.x_MsoNormal, li.x_MsoNormal, div.x_MsoNormal\\r\\n\\t{margin:0cm;\\r\\n\\tfont-size:12.0pt;\\r\\n\\tfont-family:\\"Aptos\\",sans-serif}\\r\\na:link, span.x_MsoHyperlink\\r\\n\\t{color:#467886;\\r\\n\\ttext-decoration:underline}\\r\\nspan.x_EmailStyle17\\r\\n\\t{font-family:\\"Aptos\\",sans-serif;\\r\\n\\tcolor:windowtext}\\r\\n@page WordSection1\\r\\n\\t{margin:72.0pt 72.0pt 72.0pt 72.0pt}\\r\\n-->\\r\\n</style><div lang=\\"EN-US\\" style=\\"word-wrap:break-word\\"><div class=\\"x_WordSection1\\"><p class=\\"x_MsoNormal\\">Omar, </p><p class=\\"x_MsoNormal\\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\\"x_MsoNormal\\">Please find below &amp; attached pricing for the rendering works materials for 7 Leicester Place. </p><p class=\\"x_MsoNormal\\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\\"x_MsoNormal\\">I’ve worked discount on the materials so got it down £90. </p><p class=\\"x_MsoNormal\\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\\"x_MsoNormal\\">Delivery for all stock item will be Monday / Tuesday the MR1 Monocouche one coat rending system is on a ¾ working days delivery from Jewson , phoned Seerwan and they can’t budge on the price. </p><p class=\\"x_MsoNormal\\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\\"x_MsoNormal\\">I sent him this company to see if he could match and he said no chance, <a href=\\"https://specialistrendersupplies.co.uk/products/mr1-monocouche-one-coat-render-system?srsltid=AfmBOoorcf7YQ8FJXPGt13nnhzER-mbktd2ZMiNBwADjP6HilBayW29I\\" originalsrc=\\"https://specialistrendersupplies.co.uk/products/mr1-monocouche-one-coat-render-system?srsltid=AfmBOoorcf7YQ8FJXPGt13nnhzER-mbktd2ZMiNBwADjP6HilBayW29I\\">MR1 Monocouche One Coat Render System from Specialist Render Supplies</a></p><p class=\\"x_MsoNormal\\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\\"x_MsoNormal\\">I phoned them to see if they had stock of the colour we need, he confirms he has and can get it to us for Monday / Tuesday and for a better price of £10.99 x 50 = £549.50 + £120 delivery = £669.50</p><p class=\\"x_MsoNormal\\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\\"x_MsoNormal\\">Rather than Jewson price of £13.99 x 50 = £699.50 + £120 in delivery £819.50</p><p class=\\"x_MsoNormal\\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\\"x_MsoNormal\\">£150 saving on the render plus we get 2/3 days earlier, <b><u><span style=\\"background:yellow\\">this will need to be paid on a card though.</span></u></b> </p><p class=\\"x_MsoNormal\\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\\"x_MsoNormal\\">Let me know how you would like to proceed &amp; approve. </p><p class=\\"x_MsoNormal\\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\\"x_MsoNormal\\"><img border=\\"0\\" width=\\"1023\\" height=\\"140\\" id=\\"x__x0000_i1028\\" data-outlook-trace=\\"F:1|T:1\\" src=\\"cid:image004.png@01DCCE6B.72BACEA0\\" style=\\"width:10.6562in; height:1.4583in\\"></p><p class=\\"x_MsoNormal\\">&nbsp;</p><div><p class=\\"x_MsoNormal\\" style=\\"background:white\\"><span style=\\"color:black\\">Kind regards,</span><span style=\\"\\"></span></p><p class=\\"x_MsoNormal\\" style=\\"background:white\\"><span style=\\"color:black\\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\\"x_MsoNormal\\" style=\\"background:white\\"><b><span style=\\"color:black\\">Alex Jones</span></b><span style=\\"color:black\\"></span></p><p class=\\"x_MsoNormal\\" style=\\"background:white\\"><b><span style=\\"color:black\\">Construction Buyer</span></b><span style=\\"color:black\\"></span></p><p class=\\"x_MsoNormal\\" style=\\"background:white\\"><span style=\\"color:black\\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\\"x_MsoNormal\\" style=\\"background:white\\"><b><span style=\\"color:black\\">Criterion Capital&nbsp;</span></b><b><span style=\\"color:black\\"> </span></b><b><span style=\\"color:black\\">&nbsp;</span></b><span style=\\"color:black\\"></span></p><p class=\\"x_MsoNormal\\" style=\\"background:white\\"><span style=\\"color:black\\">C/O Zedwell Hotel, Great Windmill Street, London Trocadero, London, W1D 7DH</span><span style=\\"\\"></span></p><p class=\\"x_MsoNormal\\" style=\\"background:white\\"><span style=\\"color:black\\">Telephone – Switchboard 0207 432 2444</span><span style=\\"\\"></span></p><p class=\\"x_MsoNormal\\" style=\\"background:white\\"><span style=\\"color:black\\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\\"\\"></span></p><p class=\\"x_MsoNormal\\" style=\\"background:white\\"><span style=\\"color:black\\"><img border=\\"0\\" width=\\"137\\" height=\\"40\\" id=\\"x_Picture_x0020_1\\" data-outlook-trace=\\"F:1|T:1\\" src=\\"cid:image001.png@01DCCE69.DB7C8110\\" style=\\"width:1.427in; height:.4166in\\"><img border=\\"0\\" width=\\"137\\" height=\\"45\\" id=\\"x_Picture_x0020_2\\" data-outlook-trace=\\"F:1|T:1\\" src=\\"