ore acting on any information contained herein.</span><span style=\\"\\"></span></p><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\" style=\\"background:white\\"><span style=\\"font-size:8.0pt; color:#242424\\">Authorisation: No email instruction shall authorise expenditure or create contractual obligations unless confirmed by a duly executed purchase order or written contract signed by an authorised signatory of Criterion Capital Limited.</span><span style=\\"\\"></span></p><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\" style=\\"background:white\\"><span style=\\"color:#242424\\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\\"\\"></span></p></div><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"\\">&nbsp;</span></p><div><div style=\\"border:none; border-top:solid #E1E1E1 1.0pt; padding:3.0pt 0cm 0cm 0cm\\"><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><b><span lang=\\"EN-US\\" style=\\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\\">From:</span></b><span lang=\\"EN-US\\" style=\\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\\"> Omar Orders &lt;Omar.Orders@criterioncapital.co.uk&gt; <br><b>Sent:</b> 17 April 2026 13:22<br><b>To:</b> Alex Jones &lt;Alex.Jones@criterioncapital.co.uk&gt;; Bes Lika &lt;bes@acltd.co.uk&gt;; Majid Al Jassas &lt;majid.aljassas@cromwellplumbing.co.uk&gt;; Ovie Okorafor &lt;Ovie.Okorafor@criterioncapital.co.uk&gt;; Musa Khan &lt;musa@safe-dem.com&gt;; Tim Bystedt &lt;Tim.Bystedt@criterioncapital.co.uk&gt;<br><b>Cc:</b> Harry Johns &lt;Harry.Johns@criterioncapital.co.uk&gt;; Jas Kalsi &lt;Jas.Kalsi@criterioncapital.co.uk&gt;<br><b>Subject:</b> Re: Window Rendering | 7 Leicester Place </span></p></div></div><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\">&nbsp;</p><div><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"color:black\\">What about the rendering material?</span></p></div><div><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"color:black\\">Can we get that to site today?</span></p></div><div><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"color:black\\">What is the order quantity?</span></p></div><div><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"col