a>&gt;<br><b>Cc:</b> Harry Johns &lt;<a href=\\"mailto:Harry.Johns@criterioncapital.co.uk\\">Harry.Johns@criterioncapital.co.uk</a>&gt;; Jas Kalsi &lt;<a href=\\"mailto:Jas.Kalsi@criterioncapital.co.uk\\">Jas.Kalsi@criterioncapital.co.uk</a>&gt;<br><b>Subject:</b> Window Rendering | 7 Leicester Place </span></p><div><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\">&nbsp;</p></div></div><div><div><p class=\\"xmsonormal\\"><span lang=\\"EN-US\\">Omar, </span></p><p class=\\"xmsonormal\\"><span lang=\\"EN-US\\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\\"xmsonormal\\"><span lang=\\"EN-US\\">Please find below &amp; attached pricing for the rendering works materials for 7 Leicester Place. </span></p><p class=\\"xmsonormal\\"><span lang=\\"EN-US\\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\\"xmsonormal\\"><span lang=\\"EN-US\\">I’ve worked discount on the materials so got it down £90. </span></p><p class=\\"xmsonormal\\"><span lang=\\"EN-US\\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\\"xmsonormal\\"><span lang=\\"EN-US\\">Delivery for all stock item will be Monday / Tuesday the MR1 Monocouche one coat rending system is on a ¾ working days delivery from Jewson , phoned Seerwan and they can’t budge on the price. </span></p><p class=\\"xmsonormal\\"><span lang=\\"EN-US\\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\\"xmsonormal\\"><span lang=\\"EN-US\\">I sent him this company to see if he could match and he said no chance, <a href=\\"https://specialistrendersupplies.co.uk/products/mr1-monocouche-one-coat-render-system?srsltid=AfmBOoorcf7YQ8FJXPGt13nnhzER-mbktd2ZMiNBwADjP6HilBayW29I\\">MR1 Monocouche One Coat Render System from Specialist Render Supplies</a></span></p><p class=\\"xmsonormal\\"><span lang=\\"EN-US\\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\\"xmsonormal\\"><span lang=\\"EN-US\\">I phoned them to see if they had stock of the colour we need, he confirms he has and can get it to us for Monday / Tuesday and for a better price of £10.99 x 50 = £549.50 + £120 delivery = £669.50</span></p><p class=\\"xmsonormal\\"><span lang=\\"EN-US\\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\\"xmsonormal\\"><span lang=\\"EN-US\\">Rather than Jewson price of £13.99 x 50 = £699.50 + £120 in delivery £819.50</span></p><p class=\\"xmsonormal\\"><span lang=\\"EN-US\\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\\"xmsonormal\\"><span lang=\\"EN-US\\">£150 saving on the render plus we get 2/3 days earlier, <b><u><span style=\\"color:black; background:yellow\\">this will need to be paid on a card though.</span></u></b> </span></p><p class=\\"xmsonormal\\"><span lang=\\"EN-US\\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\\"xmsonormal\\"><span lang=\\"EN-US\\">Let me know how you would like to proceed &amp; approve. </span></p><p class=\\"xmsonormal\\"><span lang=\\"EN-US\\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\\"xmsonormal\\"><span lang=\\"EN-US\\"><img border=\\"0\\" width=\\"1023\\" height=\\"140\\" id=\\"x__x005f_x0000_i1028\\" src=\\"cid:image008.png@01DCCE6E.E391CD60\\" style=\\"width:10.6562in; height:1.4583in\\"></span><span lang=\\"EN-US\\"></span></p><p class=\\"xmsonormal\\"><span lang=\\"EN-US\\">&nbsp;</span></p><div><p class=\\"xmsonormal\\" style=\\"background:white\\"><span lang=\\"EN-US\\" style=\\"color:black\\">Kind regards,</span><span lang=\\"EN-US\\"></span></p><p class=\\"xmsonormal\\" style=\\"background:white\\"><span lang=\\"EN-US\\" style=\\"color:black\\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\\"EN-US\\"></span></p><p class=\\"xmsonormal\\" style=\\"background:white\\"><b><span lang=\\"EN-US\\" style=\\"color:black\\">Alex Jones</span></b><span lang=\\"EN-US\\"></span></p><p class=\\"xmsonormal\\" style=\\"background:white\\"><b><span lang=\\"EN-US\\" style=\\"color:black\\">Construction Buyer</span></b><span lang=\\"EN-US\\"></span></p><p class=\\"xmsonormal\\" style=\\"background:white\\"><span lang=\\"EN-US\\" style=\\"color:black\\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\\"EN-US\\"></span></p><p class=\\"xmsonormal\\" style=\\"background:white\\"><b><span lang=\\"EN-US\\" style=\\"color:black\\">Criterion Capital&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></b><span lang=\\"EN-US\\"></span></p><p class=\\"xmsonormal\\" style