7b0314c0-6e66-467f-b68a-4f94df73131e	3d778a42-8957-4fcc-909e-b22d7d8fde64	<BE1PPF7F22B23B15553B7CF0CE43613A4AF93202@BE1PPF7F22B23B1.DEUP281.PROD.OUTLOOK.COM>	EMAIL	UNKNOWN	{"id": "AAMkAGUwNWEyYWNiLWJiZmMtNGVhYS1hNjI4LWMwNTcxN2U2NDhkNQBGAAAAAACnmkWfBcR7QJIFP_7xkQVRBwDjsLOgeeDySrc96zrOmMKkAAAAAAEMAADjsLOgeeDySrc96zrOmMKkAAGKnX5VAAA=", "body": {"content": "<html><head>\\r\\n<meta http-equiv=\\"Content-Type\\" content=\\"text/html; charset=utf-8\\"><meta name=\\"Generator\\" content=\\"Microsoft Word 15 (filtered medium)\\"><style>\\r\\n<!--\\r\\n@font-face\\r\\n\\t{font-family:\\"Cambria Math\\"}\\r\\n@font-face\\r\\n\\t{font-family:DengXian}\\r\\n@font-face\\r\\n\\t{font-family:Aptos}\\r\\n@font-face\\r\\n\\t{}\\r\\np.MsoNormal, li.MsoNormal, div.MsoNormal\\r\\n\\t{margin:0cm;\\r\\n\\tfont-size:12.0pt;\\r\\n\\tfont-family:\\"Aptos\\",serif}\\r\\nspan.EmailStyle17\\r\\n\\t{font-family:\\"Arial\\",sans-serif;\\r\\n\\tcolor:windowtext;\\r\\n\\tfont-weight:normal;\\r\\n\\tfont-style:normal}\\r\\n.MsoChpDefault\\r\\n\\t{}\\r\\n@page WordSection1\\r\\n\\t{margin:72.0pt 72.0pt 72.0pt 72.0pt}\\r\\ndiv.WordSection1\\r\\n\\t{}\\r\\n-->\\r\\n</style></head><body lang=\\"EN-GB\\" link=\\"#467886\\" vlink=\\"#96607D\\" style=\\"word-wrap:break-word\\"><div class=\\"WordSection1\\"><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\">Good morning,</span></p><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\">Your account is now on stop due to the overdue invoices below. Your CRA will be revoked, and any imports will be held. </span></p><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><img width=\\"1199\\" height=\\"336\\" id=\\"Picture_x0020_1\\" src=\\"cid:image001.png@01DCCE49.C4CEE4A0\\" style=\\"width:12.4895in; height:3.5in\\"><span style=\\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\\"></span></p><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:11.0pt\\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:11.0pt\\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:11.0pt\\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:11.0pt\\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:11.0pt\\">Please ensure that going forward all remittances are sent to the following email address and any current emails are removed from your system for this type of correspondence.</span></p><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:11.0pt\\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span lang=\\"FR\\" style=\\"font-size:11.0pt\\">Accountsreceivable.northampton@dachser.com</span></p><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span lang=\\"FR\\" style=\\"font-size:11.0pt\\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span lang=\\"FR\\" style=\\"font-size:11.0pt\\">Kind Regards</span></p><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span lang=\\"FR\\" style=\\"font-size:11.0pt\\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span lang=\\"FR\\" style=\\"font-size:11.0pt\\">Michelle Price</span></p><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span lang=\\"FR\\" style=\\"font-size:11.0pt\\">Accounts Receivable Manager </span></p><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span lang=\\"FR\\" style=\\"font-size:11.0pt\\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span lang=\\"FR\\" style=\\"font-size:11.0pt\\">DACHSER Ltd</span></p><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span lang=\\"FR\\" style=\\"font-size:11.0pt\\">Northampton Logistics Centre</span></p><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span lang=\\"FR\\" style=\\"font-size:11.0pt\\">Thomas Dachser Way</span></p><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:11.0pt\\">Brackmills </span></p><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:11.0pt\\">Northampton</span></p><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:11.0pt\\">NN4 7HT </span></p><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:11.0pt\\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:11.0pt\\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:11.0pt\\">Switchboard:&nbsp;&nbsp; +44 (0) 1604 433100</span></p><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span lang=\\"FR\\" style=\\"font-size:11.0pt\\">Direct Dial: &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; +44 (0) 1604 433420</span></p><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span lang=\\"FR\\" style=\\"font-size:11.0pt\\">Mobile&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;07435982560</span></p><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span lang=\\"FR\\" style=\\"font-size:11.0pt\\">dachser.co.uk</span></p><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span lang=\\"FR\\" style=\\"font-size:11.0pt\\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:11.0pt\\">IS YOUR BUSINESS CDS READY? </span></p><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:11.0pt\\">We draw your attention to the fact that HMRC will introduce the new UK Customs system CDS on the 1st October 2022. This change will effect all UK importers therefore we recommend that you take action now in order to avoid potential delays with the processing of your import customs clearances. Additional information can be found at www.dachser.co.uk, alternatively please contact our Customs specialist directly at cds.northampton@dachser.com</span></p><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:11.0pt\\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:11.0pt\\">Your attention is drawn to the relevant standard terms and conditions of trading adopted by DACHSER Limited, which are incorporated into any contract entered into by the Company. The relevant standard terms and conditions mean the most recently published edition of BIFA, RHA, CMR and UKWA. All goods carried under BIFA terms and conditions except (a) transportation of goods solely within the UK and Ireland will be subject to RHA terms and conditions, (b) for international transport by road, CMR will apply by convention in all aspects, and (c) static storage of goods within the UK will be subject to UKWA terms and conditions. For further information go to dachser.com/gb/en/General-Terms-Conditions_315.htm </span></p><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:11.0pt\\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:11.0pt\\">********** Legal Notice **********</span></p><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:11.0pt\\">This document and the information contained herein and in any attached files is the property of Dachser Ltd. </span></p><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:11.0pt\\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:11.0pt\\">All information contained in the document or any attached files is confidential and must not be published, reproduced, or disseminated in any way without the prior written permission of Dachser Ltd. This document is intended for the addressee only and, if you have received it in error, please advise the sender and delete it from your system.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></p><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:11.0pt\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span lang=\\"DE\\" style=\\"font-size:11.0pt\\">Dachser Ltd</span></p><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span lang=\\"DE\\" style=\\"font-size:11.0pt\\">Registered in England No. 1195803</span></p><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\"><span style=\\"font-size:11.0pt\\">Registered office: Thomas Dachser Way, Brackmills, Northampton, NN4 7HT</span></p><p class=\\"MsoNormal\\">&nbsp;</p></div></body></html>", "contentType": "html"}, "from": {"emailAddress": {"name": "mic