eec7aed2-ee87-4214-a192-4217e443123d	3d778a42-8957-4fcc-909e-b22d7d8fde64	<AM8P192MB0916766F4363B1EDD0EEEC0CB8202@AM8P192MB0916.EURP192.PROD.OUTLOOK.COM>	EMAIL	DELIVERY_UPDATE	{"id": "AAMkAGUwNWEyYWNiLWJiZmMtNGVhYS1hNjI4LWMwNTcxN2U2NDhkNQBGAAAAAACnmkWfBcR7QJIFP_7xkQVRBwDjsLOgeeDySrc96zrOmMKkAAAAAAEMAADjsLOgeeDySrc96zrOmMKkAAGKnX5dAAA=", "body": {"content": "<html><head>\\r\\n<meta http-equiv=\\"Content-Type\\" content=\\"text/html; charset=utf-8\\"><style type=\\"text/css\\" style=\\"display:none\\">\\r\\n<!--\\r\\np\\r\\n\\t{margin-top:0;\\r\\n\\tmargin-bottom:0}\\r\\n-->\\r\\n</style></head><body dir=\\"ltr\\"><div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\\">Hi Majid</div><div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\\"><br></div><div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\\">As requested I have put together some items that we are looking at for our new bathroom.&nbsp;</div><div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\\">The layout is roughly like the attached mockup</div><div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\\">We are interested in an L-shaped bath/shower to give more space when showering.&nbsp;</div><div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\\"><br></div><div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\\">We like white suite with black details.&nbsp;</div><div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\\">Have also attached a mockup of the overall look and feel, mocked up using AI - but the shower will be on the other end of the bath and we think black not gold taps etc, as we thought gold might be harder to clean?</div><div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\\"><br></div><table cellspacing=\\"0\\" cellpadding=\\"0\\" border=\\"1\\" data-sheets-root=\\"1\\" data-sheets-baot=\\"1\\" style=\\"direction:ltr; border-width:medium; border-style:none; border-color:currentcolor; width:0px; table-layout:fixed; border-collapse:collapse; border-spacing:0px; box-sizing:border-box\\"><tbody><tr><td style=\\"direction:ltr; border-width:1px; border-style:solid; border-color:rgb(204,204,204); background-color:rgb(182,215,168); padding:2px 3px; vertical-align:bottom; width:191px; height:21px\\"><div class=\\"skipProofing\\" style=\\"direction:ltr; font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\\">Showerscreen and bath</div></td><td style=\\"direction:ltr; border-width:1px; border-style:solid; border-color:rgb(204,204,204); background-color:rgb(182,215,168); padding:2px 3px; vertical-align:bottom; color:rgb(17,85,204); width:973px; height:21px\\"><div class=\\"skipProofing\\" style=\\"direction:ltr; font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\\"><a href=\\"https://www.bigbathroomshop.co.uk/milano-elswick-modern-l-shaped-shower-bath-choice-of-screen-size-panels-and-left-right-hand-options-88085?gclsrc=aw.ds&amp;gad_source=1&amp;gad_campaignid=21259140477&amp;gbraid=0AAAAAD6PHKgAEniMGgai5zqVWh8IAQ8oO&amp;gclid=CjwKCAjwhLPOBhBiEiwA8_wJHDudG_QWVPKLgpMCmCkygDVW2zs-2kEcxWnf1F29eIzdiMi0GzFawBoCGgYQAvD_BwE#377=9759&amp;371=1995&amp;483=9513\\" target=\\"_blank\\" id=\\"OWA97ff03a1-3d77-8f00-8ba1-97c1ef77a0ea\\" class=\\"in-cell-link OWAAutoLink\\"><u>https://www.bigbathroomshop.co.uk/milano-elswick-modern-l-shaped-shower-bath-choice-of-screen-size-panels-and-left-right-hand-options-88085?gclsrc=aw.ds&amp;gad_source=1&amp;gad_campaignid=21259140477&amp;gbraid=0AAAAAD6PHKgAEniMGgai5zqVWh8IAQ8oO&amp;gclid=CjwKCAjwhLPOBhBiEiwA8_wJHDudG_QWVPKLgpMCmCkygDVW2zs-2kEcxWnf1F29eIzdiMi0GzFawBoCGgYQAvD_BwE#377=9759&amp;371=1995&amp;483=9513</u></a></div></td></tr><tr><td style=\\"direction:ltr; border-width:1px; border-style:solid; border-color:rgb(204,204,204); background-color:rgb(182,215,168); padding:2px 3px; vertical-align:bottom; width:191px; height:21px\\"><div class=\\"skipProofing\\" style=\\"direction:ltr; font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\\">Vanity unit 3</div></td><td style=\\"direction:ltr; border-width:1px; border-style:solid; border-color:rgb(204,204,204); background-color:rgb(182,215,168); padding:2px 3px; vertical-align:bottom; color:rgb(17,85,204); width:973px; height:21px\\"><div class=\\"skipProofing\\" style=\\"direction:ltr; font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\\"><a href=\\"https://www.easybathrooms.com/winslow-600mm-wall-mounted-vanity-unit-basin-light-swan-oak\\" target=\\"_blank\\" id=\\"OWA781f8ff4-646b-f189-8686-9539644225b9\\" class=\\"in-cell-link OWAAutoLink\\"><u>https://www.easybathrooms.com/winslow-600mm-wall-mounted-vanity-unit-basin-light-swan-oak</u></a></div></td></tr><tr><td style=\\"direction:ltr; border-width:1px; border-style:solid; border-color:rgb(204,204,204); background-color:rgb(182,215,168); padding:2px 3px; vertical-align:bottom; width:191px; height:21px\\"><div class=\\"skipProofing\\" style=\\"direction:ltr; font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\\">Black basin tap (Zena)</div></td><td style=\\"direction:ltr; border-width:1px; border-style:solid; border-color:rgb(204,204,204); background-color:rgb(182,215,168); padding:2px 3px; vertical-align:bottom; color:rgb(17,85,204); width:973px; height:21px\\"><div class=\\"skipProofing\\" style=\\"direction:ltr; font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\\"><a href=\\"https://www.easybathrooms.com/zena-black-basin-mono-tap\\" target=\\"_blank\\" id=\\"OWA007be1de-ed1f-6af7-5dad-5e1b34a23b5d\\" class=\\"in-cell-link OWAAutoLink\\"><u>https://www.easybathrooms.com/zena-black-basin-mono-tap</u></a></div></td></tr><tr><td style=\\"direction:ltr; border-width:1px; border-style:solid; border-color:rgb(204,204,204); background-color:rgb(182,215,168); padding:2px 3px; vertical-align:bottom; width:191px; height:21px\\"><div class=\\"skipProofing\\" style=\\"direction:ltr; font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\\">Doubel shower head (Zena)</div></td><td style=\\"direction:ltr; border-width:1px; border-style:solid; border-color:rgb(204,204,204); background-color:rgb(182,215,168); padding:2px 3px; vertical-align:bottom; color:rgb(17,85,204); width:973px; height:21px\\"><div class=\\"skipProofing\\" style=\\"direction:ltr; font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\\"><a href=\\"https://www.easybathrooms.com/zena-square-double-outlet-valve-with-slide-rail-kit-shower-head-and-arm-black\\" target=\\"_blank\\" id=\\"OWA335913cf-ef6f-a97a-ac3d-ea0abfd5c801\\" class=\\"in-cell-link OWAAutoLink\\"><u>https://www.easybathrooms.com/zena-square-double-outlet-valve-with-slide-rail-kit-shower-head-and-arm-black</u></a></div></td></tr><tr><td style=\\"direction:ltr; border-width:1px; border-style:solid; border-color:rgb(204,204,204); background-color:rgb(182,215,168); padding:2px 3px; vertical-align:bottom; width:191px; height:21px\\"><div class=\\"skipProofing\\" style=\\"direction:ltr; font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\\">Mirror cabinet 1200x700&nbsp;</div></td><td style=\\"direction:ltr; border-width:1px; border-style:solid; border-color:rgb(204,204,204); background-color:rgb(182,215,168); padding:2px 3px; vertical-align:bottom; color:rgb(17,85,204); width:973px; height:21px\\"><div class=\\"skipProofing\\" style=\\"direction:ltr; font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\\"><a href=\\"https://www.easybathrooms.com/corton-700-x-1200mm-led-mirrored-wall-cabinet\\" target=\\"_blank\\" id=\\"OWA187fda80-6626-5356-ccbc-3e79317b39a3\\" class=\\"in-cell-link OWAAutoLink\\"><u>https://www.easybathrooms.com/corton-700-x-1200mm-led-mirrored-wall-cabinet</u></a></div></td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\\"><br></div><div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\\">Those are some of the bits we are looking at. The mirror cabinet we want to be 1200x700 but relaxed about style so particularly with that one if you can find a cheaper alternative then great.</div><div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\\"><br></div><div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\\"><br></div><div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\\">Regarding toilets, perhaps an unusual request, but we are removing a bidet from our current bathroom and wondered if bidet/toilet combos are a thing in the UK, Japanese style. What can you tell us about this as far as what our options are? Would something like this work for us? <a href=\\"https://www.betterbathrooms.com/p/purificare-wall-hung-toilet-with-grohe-frame-and-black-flush-plate-bun38811243090664?refsource=bbadwords&amp;utm_source=google&amp;utm_medium=cpc&amp;utm_id=23496302805&amp;cq_src=google_ads&amp;cq_cmp=23496302805&amp;cq_con=&amp;cq_term=&amp;cq_med=pla_with_promotion&amp;cq_plac=&amp;cq_net=x&amp;cq_pos=&amp;cq_plt=gp&amp;gad_source=1&amp;gad_campaignid=23501335403&amp;gbraid=0AAAAAC0TOn9K4lh851QbOzd79Eixpdedo&amp;gclid=Cj0KCQjw7cLOBhDmARIsAGsuA0lWpvAUIl2sYtnQk1jE_-lJ9acKU6Q686pcxtm8Ym7uhESgcfZ-FEQaAkP_EALw_wcB\\">https://www.betterbathrooms.com/p/purificare-wall-hung-toilet-with-grohe-frame-and-black-flush-plate-bun38811243090664?refsource=bbadwords&amp;utm_source=google&amp;utm_medium=cpc&amp;utm_id=23496302805&amp;cq_src=google_ads&amp;cq_cmp=23496302805&amp;cq_con=&amp;cq_term=&amp;cq_med=pla_with_promotion&amp;cq_plac=&amp;cq_net=x&amp;cq_pos=&amp;cq_plt=gp&amp;gad_source=1&amp;gad_campaignid=23501335403&amp;gbraid=0AAAAAC0TOn9K4lh851QbOzd79Eixpdedo&amp;gclid=Cj0KCQjw7cLOBhDmARIsAGsuA0lWpvAUIl2sYtnQk1jE_-lJ9acKU6Q686pcxtm8Ym7uhESgcfZ-FEQaAkP_EALw_wcB</a></div><div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\\"><br></div><div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\\">Or could that be problematic for any reason</div><div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\\"><br></div><div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\\">I haven't looked at tiles yet but we know the sort of things we want, as you can see from the mockup, slate dark tiles for floors and half wall, and more of a shimmery green around the shower/bath.</div><div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\\"><br></div><div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\\">Please let me know if I am missing anything?</div><div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\\">Thanks!</div><div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\\">Lucy</div><div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\\"><br></div><div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\\"><br></div></body></html>", "contentType": "html"}, "from": {"emailAddress": {"name": "Lucy Mair", "address": "lucypmair@outlook.com"}}, "_folder": "INBOX", "subject": "Bathroom - Chessington KT9 1EG", "@odata.etag": "W/\\"CQAAABYAAADjsLOgeeDySrc96zrOmMKkAAGJtVV6\\"", "bodyPreview": "Hi Majid\\r\\n\\r\\nAs requested I have put together some items that we are looking at for our new bathroom.\\r\\nThe layout is roughly like the attached mockup\\r\\nWe are interested in an L-shaped bath/shower to give more space when showering.\\r\\n\\r\\nWe like white suite wi", "ccRecipients": [], "toRecipients": [{"emailAddress": {"name": "Majid Al Jassas", "address": "majid.aljassas@cromwellplumbing.co.uk"}}], "conversationId": "AAQkAGUwNWEyYWNiLWJiZmMtNGVhYS1hNjI4LWMwNTcxN2U2NDhkNQAQAAgSV-EplrVEjTVQx6o6Od8=", "hasAttachments": true, "receivedDateTime": "2026-04-17T11:23:46Z", "internetMessageId": "<AM8P192MB0916766F4363B1EDD0EEEC0CB8202@AM8P192MB0916.EURP192.PROD.OUTLOOK.COM>"}	\N	2026-04-17 11:23:46	\N	ACTIONED	\N	2026-04-17 11:31:34.559
