ack your order is using our Track My Order function on the Victorian Plumbing website. Input both your order number and email address in order to start tracking. We’ll email you throughout your order’s journey so you know when to expect it. Returning items If you would like to return an item from your order, it’s important that you follow the steps in our Help Centre . Items must be returned within 30 days, please ensure the item is not damaged or marked and within its original packaging. I have a refund query If you have returned an item to us, your refund can take up to 10 working days to be processed once received at our Returns Centre. If you are waiting on any type of refund, this may take up to 5 working days once processed. If you are still waiting, contact us via our Refunds Section in the Help Centre. I have a damaged or faulty item We’re sorry if you have received a damaged or faulty item. Please create a report in our Help Centre so we can resolve this as quickly as possible. Please do not fit or dispose of any damaged goods, as we will be unable to replace or refund damaged items which have been installed. This Is A No Reply Email This update is sent from an address that cannot receive email. Replies to this email will not be seen by our team. The quickest way to get help is to report an issue via our Help Centre . Get In Touch Help Centre We want to direct you to the right department as quickly as possible. To help us direct your query, please report issues via our Help Centre, where you’ll be able to self-serve or log a ticket with a member of the team. Live Chat Our colleagues are available to chat. You can initiate a conversation from any page of our website using the Need Help? widget located in the lower left (desktop devices) or bottom of your screen (mobile devices). Email: info@victorianplumbing.co.uk © 1999 - 2024 Victorian Plumbing, 1 Sustainability Way, Farington Moss, Leyland, PR26 6TB, United Kingdom is authorised and regulated by the Finan