t (Dry)\n20068\nWX RANGE\nProtection\nVariants\nHorizontal Split Variant\nEnables to the ability to split the ScubaTANK in half. This \nenables easy access for low door ways and tight spaces on \nroute to its final installation location.\nWX2-9060-0800-M\nPRODUCT DATA SHEET\nMotor Power\nIP Rating\nDelivery connection\nInlet connection\nSpeed\nMaximum system \npressure Rating\nClosed Valve pressure\nMax operating \npressure\nMax operating flow \n(per pump)\n6.9 bar\nSpecification\nwww.dutypoint.com\n23 °C\n*For high temperature application please contact \nthe office.\nMaximum operating \ntemperature*\nAnti-Seize technology which rotates all pumps during low or \nzero usage and prevents the pumps from seizing up.\nRemote Mounted Panel Variant .\nProvides wall mounting options with the Vessel supplied \nloose for downstream installation.\n*please refer to separate information sheets for further details on these variant options\n50 Hz\n45 Hz\n40 Hz\n30 Hz\n0\n1\n2\n3\n4\n5\n6\n7\n02468101214161820222426283032\n0\n10\n20\n30\n40\n50\n60\n70\n80\n0.01.02.03.04.05.06.07.08.09.0\nHead (Bar)\nFlow (m³/hr)\nHead (metres)\nFlow (l/s)\nSet Performance\n\nWX2-9060-0800-M\nDWG2-800AF\nDocument #Revision:\n1\nSpecifications and illustrations are subject to revision without notice. Dutypoint Ltd is not liable for any incompleteness or inaccuracies.\nwww.dutypoint.com\n1160\nTechnical Drawing\nVoltage/Phase/Frequency\nElectrical Data\nWX RANGE\nWX Model Codes\nPRODUCT DATA SHEET\n1182\nOperating speed range\n1035\nDimension B\nDimension A'\nDrawing dimensions\nPer pump Current @ Full Load\n9.2 A\nSupply\n230/1/50\nDimension A\n1334\n20069DOC-\n30 - 50Hz\n1553\nDimension B'\nTotal Current @ Full Load\n18.4 A\nDimension C	{"cc": [], "to": [{"name": "Majid Al Jassas", "address": "majid.aljassas@cromwellplumbing.co.uk"}], "from": {"name": "Lee Dawson", "address": "ld@jacksonsofhollandpark.co.uk"}, "subject": "Quote", "conversationId": "AAQkAGUwNWEyYWNiLWJiZmMtNGVhYS1hNjI4LWMwNTcxN2U2N