urchased by CDL 10 Mirrors with minor dust ingress to be returned to IM for cleaning (FOC) These are to supplied as part of phase 2 order 6 Additional Mirror order for ZPAR phase 2 21 Total new mirror order 37 Mirrors to be supplied by Illuminated Mirrors FOC under warranty 9 If this is all agreeable I will need a ProForma quote from @Majid Al Jassas for 37 mirrors. Jamie, Majid please confirm your best, expedited lead time if we can place this order by, at the latest, April 9th. Thanks Theo Williams Design &amp; Buying Criterion Developments Ltd c/o Zedwell Piccadilly Hotel Great Windmill St London Trocadero W1D 7DH Mobile - 07958325649 Landline - 02074322453 theo.williams@criterioncapital.co.uk www.criterioncapital.co.uk From: Theo Williams &lt;Theo.Williams@criterioncapital.co.uk&gt; Sent: Friday, February 20, 2026 8:59 AM To: 'Leigh Warr' &lt;leighwarr.swl@gmail.com&gt;; 'Majid Al Jassas' &lt;majid.aljassas@cromwellplumbing.co.uk&gt; Cc: jamie@alannahrose.co.uk &lt;jamie@alannahrose.co.uk&gt;; 'mark.hudd' &lt;mark.hudd@illuminated-mirrors.co.uk&gt;; Chris Rhodes &lt;Chris.Rhodes@criterioncapital.co.uk&gt; Subject: Re: Mirror consultation. Leigh, Majid - can you update me on the progress of the new mirror sample? The plan was to have this installed at Park Lane last week. Can we get it installed start of next week please? Theo Williams Design &amp; Buying Criterion Developments Ltd c/o Zedwell Piccadilly Hotel Great Windmill St London Trocadero W1D 7DH Mobile - 07958325649 Landline - 02074322453 theo.williams@criterioncapital.co.uk www.criterioncapital.co.uk From: Theo Williams &lt;Theo.Williams@criterioncapital.co.uk&gt; Sent: Tuesday, February 3, 2026 4:47 PM To: 'Leigh Warr' &lt;leighwarr.swl@gmail.com&gt; Cc: jamie@alannahrose.co.uk &lt;jamie@alannahrose.co.uk&gt;; 'Majid Al Jassas' &lt;majid.aljassas@cromwellplumbing.co.uk&gt;; 'mark.hudd' &lt;mark.hudd@illuminated-mirrors.co.uk&gt; Subject: Re: Mirror consultation. Hi Leigh How is the VII sample mirror goin