e6102bc3-8ec6-416b-bf35-8ecd52c03926	08d54de4-d043-413b-9ad4-a04174c26247	Subject: Luton Mosque -  material quote please \nFrom: Asif Usmani <Asif@reach-cm.co.uk>\nDate: 2026-04-02T13:30:01Z\n\nSalam Majid, I hope all is well. Can you provide me with a quote for the following, lead times noted below: 5 pallets : Ketley Red Solid Class A Engineering Brick 65mm | Pack of 400 (need in 2 weeks) 200 LM : ARC Cavity Stop Sock 100mm x 1200 long 1hr rated ( need in 5 weeks ) 60 sqm : 100m below DPC insulation A1 (spec attached) (Need in 2 weeks ) – alternatives can be considered providing A1 rated and 100mm I look forward to hearing from you. Kind regards ​ ​ ​ ​ Asif Usmani Procurement Manager T: +442070466359 WINNER: London Construction Awards 2025, Commercial Project of the Year, The Hobson ​FINALIST: London Construction Awards 2025, Commercial Project of the Year, The Wellington 50 Havelock Terrace, London SW8 4AL | Main: +44 (0)20 7046 6311 ​Company registered in England &amp; Wales. Registered address: 14th Floor, 33 Cavendish Square, London W1G 0PW. Registered no: 14654487 ​ Disclaimer: The information contained in this communication is confidential. It is intended solely for use by the addressee. If you are not the addressee, any disclosure, copying, distribution or taking action in relation to this information is strictly prohibited and may be unlawful. The Company undertakes all reasonable efforts to ensure this communication has been scanned for viruses, etc, however email transmission cannot be guaranteed as secure.\n\n--- BEWI-Below-DPC-Cavity-Insulation-Datasheet_1124.pdf ---\n\n\nBEWI Below DPC Cavity Insulation\nTechnical Datasheet\nFor more information:   \nbewi.com    e-mail: sales.insulation.uk@bewi.com    Tel: 0870 600 3666\n© BEWI   TDS-02W-BDI-V02    NOV 2024 \nOur Below DPC (Damp Proof Course) Cavity Insulation \nis manufactured from expanded polystyrene (EPS) \nand is designed to be installed in a cavity wall below \nDPC level.\nInstalling this product will remove the thermal bridge at the \njunction between the ground floor and the external wall and \nassists in achieving compliance to Part L1.\nKey Benefits\n Supplied in EPS 70E grade (with flame retardent) \nor EPS 70 (without flame retardent)\n Extends cavity insulation below floor slab level \n Resistant to ground moisture penetration \n Unaffected by air infiltration\n Lightweight and easy to handle and install \n I   mproves Psi value\n Links floor and wall insulation\n Provides perimeter insulation to floors\n 100% recyclable\nBEWI Below DPC Cavity Insulation is supplied as EPS 70 (as \ndefined in BS EN 13163) and is available in 4 types:\n1\n     Below DPC Cavity Insulation Standard \n(Non Flame Retardant – Reaction to Fire Class F) – \n0.038 W/mk\n2\n     Below DPC Cavity Insulation HP+ \n(Non Flame Retardant – Reaction to Fire Class F) – \n0.030 W/mk\n3     Below DPC Cavity Insulation Standard \n(Flame Retardant – Reaction to Fire Class E) – \n0.038 W/mk\n4\n     \nB\nelow DPC Cavity Insulation HP+ \n(Flame Retardant – Reaction to Fire Class E) – \n0.030 W/mk\nBelow DPC \nCavity \nInsulation\n\nBEWI Below DPC Cavity Insulation\nTechnical Datasheet\nFor more information:   \nbewi.com    e-mail: sales.insulation.uk@bewi.com    Tel: 0870 600 3666\n© BEWI   TDS-02W-BDI-V02    NOV 2024 \nProperties:\nDimensions:\nStandard size: 1200mm x 375mm \n1200mm x 450mm\n \n1200mm x 600mm\nStandar\nd thickness: \n50mm, 70mm, 90mm\n \n110mm and 140mm\nO\nther depths and thicknesses are available to order.\nEasy t\no install\nBEWI Below DPC Cavity Insulation is manufactured from \nexpanded polystyrene (EPS) which is lightweight, easy to \nhandle and cut. It is easily installed and there is generally no \nneed for specialised trades or equipment.\nEnvironment\nEPS has been awarded an A+ rating by the BRE’s Green Guide \nto specification.\nPermanent\nBEWI Below DPC Cavity Insulation is rot- proof and durable \nand will remain effective for the life of the building and has \nthe added advantage of being flood-resilient.\nThermal Resistance\nBelow DPC Cavity Insulation thickness\nBelow DPC Cavity Insulation Standard *\n0.038 W/mk\nBelow DPC Cavity Insulation HP+ *\n0.030 W/mk\n50 mm1.30 m\n2\nK/W1.65 m\n2\nK/W\n70 mm1.80 m\n2\nK/W2.30 m\n2\nK/W\n90 mm2.35 m\n2\nK/W3.00 m\n2\nK/W\n110 mm2.85 m\n2\nK/W3.65 m\n2\nK/W\n140 mm3.65 m\n2\nK/W4.65 m\n2\nK/W\n* Available in Non Flame Retardant - Reaction to Class F and Flame Retardant - Reaction to Class  Class E\nRefer to the national Building Regulations for types of \nbuildings and any product restrictions / exclusions that may \napply prior to use and or inclusion in any specification.\nDisclaimer: Every effort has been made to ensure the correctness of the information provided in this data sheet and is based on data and knowledge accurate at \nthe time of production. It is designed for experienced professionals in the building and construction industry and does not offer a complete overview of industry \npractices. Therefore, this cannot guarantee the performance results, as usage and installation conditions are outside our control.  \nIf you have any questions regarding the suitability of the application, please contact us.	{"cc": [{"name": "Jonathon McElhinney", "address": "Jonathon@reach-cm.co.uk"}, {"name": "Sunny Jaffri", "address": "Sunny@reach-cm.co.uk"}], "to": [{"name": "Majid Al Jassas", "address": "majid.aljassas@cromwellplumbing.co.uk"}], "from": {"name": "Asif Usmani", "address": "Asif@reach-cm.co.uk"}, "subject": "Luton Mosque -  material quote please ", "conversationId": "AAQkAGUwNWEyYWNiLWJiZmMtNGVhYS1hNjI4LWMwNTcxN2U2NDhkNQAQADnBWkOU_n9Eg6AGDznNQyo=", "hasAttachments": true, "attachmentCount": 1, "hasAttachmentText": true}	EMAIL	\N	1	2026-04-16 09:15:40.852
