are-wall-hung-toilet-with-grohe-frame-and-black-flush-plate-bun38811243090664?refsource=bbadwords&amp;utm_source=google&amp;utm_medium=cpc&amp;utm_id=23496302805&amp;cq_src=google_ads&amp;cq_cmp=23496302805&amp;cq_con=&amp;cq_term=&amp;cq_med=pla_with_promotion&amp;cq_plac=&amp;cq_net=x&amp;cq_pos=&amp;cq_plt=gp&amp;gad_source=1&amp;gad_campaignid=23501335403&amp;gbraid=0AAAAAC0TOn9K4lh851QbOzd79Eixpdedo&amp;gclid=Cj0KCQjw7cLOBhDmARIsAGsuA0lWpvAUIl2sYtnQk1jE_-lJ9acKU6Q686pcxtm8Ym7uhESgcfZ-FEQaAkP_EALw_wcB Or could that be problematic for any reason I haven't looked at tiles yet but we know the sort of things we want, as you can see from the mockup, slate dark tiles for floors and half wall, and more of a shimmery green around the shower/bath. Please let me know if I am missing anything? Thanks! Lucy\n\n--- WhatsApp Image 2026-01-22 at 13.04.29.jpeg ---\na, | hes | f\nal haa k (aii\neo ’ , ua\nal i\n\n--- WhatsApp Image 2026-04-13 at 08.03.07.jpeg ---\nPe\nBathroom)\nfo	{"cc": [], "to": [{"name": "Majid Al Jassas", "address": "majid.aljassas@cromwellplumbing.co.uk"}], "from": {"name": "Lucy Mair", "address": "lucypmair@outlook.com"}, "subject": "Bathroom - Chessington KT9 1EG", "conversationId": "AAQkAGUwNWEyYWNiLWJiZmMtNGVhYS1hNjI4LWMwNTcxN2U2NDhkNQAQAAgSV-EplrVEjTVQx6o6Od8=", "hasAttachments": true, "attachmentCount": 2, "hasAttachmentText": true}	EMAIL	\N	1	2026-04-17 11:31:37.311
