d8263a00-e3ca-4db0-af99-2ac9d977bc18	\N	\N	\N	fe222234-395a-41d9-b1a6-7f20f4f2842f	\N	\N	Cash — Bathroom	Subject: Bathroom - Chessington KT9 1EG\nFrom: Lucy Mair <lucypmair@outlook.com>\nDate: 2026-04-17T11:23:46Z\n\nHi Majid As requested I have put together some items that we are looking at for our new bathroom. The layout is roughly like the attached mockup We are interested in an L-shaped bath/shower to give more space when showering. We like white suite with black details. Have also attached a mockup of the overall look and feel, mocked up using AI - but the shower will be on the other end of the bath and we think black not gold taps etc, as we thought gold might be harder to clean? Showerscreen and bath https://www.bigbathroomshop.co.uk/milano-elswick-modern-l-shaped-shower-bath-choice-of-screen-size-panels-and-left-right-hand-options-88085?gclsrc=aw.ds&amp;gad_source=1&amp;gad_campaignid=21259140477&amp;gbraid=0AAAAAD6PHKgAEniMGgai5zqVWh8IAQ8oO&amp;gclid=CjwKCAjwhLPOBhBiEiwA8_wJHDudG_QWVPKLgpMCmCkygDVW2zs-2kEcxWnf1F29eIzdiMi0GzFawBoCGgYQAvD_BwE#377=9759&amp;371=1995&amp;483=9513 Vanity unit 3 https://www.easybathrooms.com/winslow-600mm-wall-mounted-vanity-unit-basin-light-swan-oak Black basin tap (Zena) https://www.easybathrooms.com/zena-black-basin-mono-tap Doubel shower head (Zena) https://www.easybathrooms.com/zena-square-double-outlet-valve-with-slide-rail-kit-shower-head-and-arm-black Mirror cabinet 1200x700 https://www.easybathrooms.com/corton-700-x-1200mm-led-mirrored-wall-cabinet Those are some of the bits we are looking at. The mirror cabinet we want to be 1200x700 but relaxed about style so particularly with that one if you can find a cheaper alternative then great. Regarding toilets, perhaps an unusual request, but we are removing a bidet from our current bathroom and wondered if bidet/toilet combos are a thing in the UK, Japanese style. What can you tell us about this as far as what our options are? Would something like this work for us? https://www.betterbathrooms.com/p/purificare-wall-hung-toilet-with-grohe-frame-and-black-flush-plate-bun38811243090664?refsource=bbadwords&amp;utm_source=google&amp;utm_medium=cpc&amp;utm_id=23496302805&amp;cq_src=google_ads&amp;cq_cmp=23496302805&amp;cq_con=&amp;cq_term=&amp;cq_med=pla_with_promotion&amp;cq_plac=&amp;cq_net=x&amp;cq_pos=&amp;cq_plt=gp&amp;gad_source=1&amp;gad_campaignid=23501335403&amp;gbraid=0AAAAAC0TOn9K4lh851QbOzd79Eixpdedo&amp;gclid=Cj0KCQjw7cLOBhDmARIsAGsuA0lWpvAUIl2sYtnQk1jE_-lJ9acKU6Q686pcxtm8Ym7uhESgcfZ-FEQaAkP_EALw_wcB Or could that be problematic for any reason I haven't looked at tiles yet but we know the sort of things we want, as you can see from the mockup, slate dark tiles for floors and half wall, and more of a shimmery green around the shower/bath. Please let me know if I am missing anything? Thanks! Lucy\n\n--- WhatsApp Image 2026-01-22 at 13.04.29.jpeg ---\na, | hes | f\nal haa k (aii\neo ’ , ua\nal i\n\n--- WhatsApp Image 2026-04-13 at 08.03.07.jpeg ---\nPe\nBathroom)\nfo	PRICING_FIRST	\N	CAPTURED	f	\N	f	\N	f	f	2026-04-17 11:36:32.462	\N	2026-04-17 12:10:20.568	OPERATIONAL	f	92	f	f	\N	EMAIL	lucypmair@outlook.com	\N	\N	\N	\N	2026-04-17 11:36:32.45
